+
+msgid ""
+"| `/nightly <test_cases> --profile` | Capture profiling traces during "
+"selected YAML-driven AISBench performance benchmarks |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `/nightly <test_cases> --profile` | 在选定的 YAML 驱动的 AISBench 性能基准测试期间采集性能分析 "
+"trace |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `/nightly <test_cases> --vllm-ref <ref>` | Install the given vllm commit /"
+" tag / branch instead of the image-baked vllm |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `/nightly <test_cases> --vllm-ref <ref>` | 安装指定的 vllm commit / tag / "
+"分支，而不是镜像中预置的 vllm |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use `--vllm-ref <ref>` to override the upstream vllm version. `<ref>` is a "
+"vllm commit SHA (full 40-char SHA recommended — GitHub cannot fetch "
+"abbreviated SHAs directly), a release tag (e.g. `v0.29.0`), or a branch name"
+" (e.g. `main`). The ref is fetched into the image's editable checkout at "
+"`/vllm-workspace/vllm` and reinstalled with `VLLM_TARGET_DEVICE=empty` (no "
+"kernel compilation), on single-node, multi-node, and accuracy test jobs "
+"alike; on multi-node it is installed in every pod. This applies to `/weekly`"
+" as well. Not specifying `--vllm-ref` keeps the vllm version baked into the "
+"nightly image, exactly as before."
+msgstr ""
+"使用 `--vllm-ref <ref>` 覆盖上游 vllm 版本。`<ref>` 可以是 vllm 的 commit SHA（建议使用完整的 40 "
+"位 SHA——GitHub 无法直接获取缩写 SHA）、发布 tag（例如 `v0.29.0`）或分支名（例如 `main`）。该 ref "
+"会被拉取到镜像中位于 `/vllm-workspace/vllm` 的可编辑检出目录，并以 `VLLM_TARGET_DEVICE=empty` "
+"重新安装（不编译 kernel），单节点、多节点和精度测试任务均如此；在多节点场景下，每个 pod 中都会安装。此选项同样适用于 "
+"`/weekly`。不指定 `--vllm-ref` 时，将保持 nightly 镜像中预置的 vllm 版本，与之前完全一致。"
+
+msgid ""
+"> **Note**: vllm derives its version from git tags at build time. A release tag installs the exact version (e.g. `0.29.0+empty`), but a bare SHA or branch name carries no tag information, so the installed version falls back to `0.1.dev1+g<sha>` — a warning is printed in the job log when this happens. Version-gated code paths in vllm-ascend may misbehave under such a fallback version, so prefer release tags for reliable results.\n"
+">\n"
+"> **Note**: vllm-ascend only tracks a specific vllm version per branch (see the `vLLM version:` line auto-maintained in the PR description). Passing an incompatible vllm ref may fail at install time or at the runtime version check; for a dev commit, set the `VLLM_VERSION` env var as described in the [versioning policy](versioning_policy.md) if needed. Also note that with `--aop_enabled`, the bisect pipeline may re-switch vllm to the version expected by each bisected commit."
+msgstr ""
+"> **注意**：vllm 在构建时从 git tag 推导其版本。发布 tag 会安装精确的版本（例如 `0.29.0+empty`），但裸 SHA 或分支名不携带 tag 信息，因此安装的版本会回退为 `0.1.dev1+g<sha>`——发生这种情况时，任务日志中会打印一条警告。vllm-ascend 中受版本控制的代码路径在此类回退版本下可能出现异常，因此建议优先使用发布 tag 以获得可靠结果。\n"
+">\n"
+"> **注意**：vllm-ascend 每个分支仅跟踪特定的 vllm 版本（参见 PR 描述中自动维护的 `vLLM version:` 行）。传入不兼容的 vllm ref 可能在安装时或运行时版本检查时失败；对于开发 commit，如有需要，请按照[版本策略](versioning_policy.md)设置 `VLLM_VERSION` 环境变量。另请注意，启用 `--aop_enabled` 时，bisect 流水线可能会将 vllm 重新切换为每个被 bisect 的 commit 所期望的版本。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use `--profile` to collect Ascend PyTorch Profiler traces. Select benchmarks by\n"
+"their exact YAML keys and choose either a time offset or a successful-request\n"
+"completion threshold:"
+msgstr ""
+"使用 `--profile` 采集昇腾 PyTorch Profiler trace。通过基准测试的精确 YAML key "
+"选择基准测试，并选择时间偏移或成功请求完成阈值之一："
+
+msgid "| Option | Default | Meaning |"
+msgstr "| 选项 | 默认值 | 含义 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile-benchmark-names <names>` | All performance benchmarks | Comma-"
+"separated YAML benchmark keys to capture. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `--profile-benchmark-names <names>` | 所有性能基准测试 | 要采集的 YAML 基准测试 key，以逗号分隔。"
+" |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile-start-after <seconds>` | `60` | Delay from the first formal "
+"request, after AISBench internal warmup. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `--profile-start-after <seconds>` | `60` | 从首个正式请求开始计算的延迟，在 AISBench "
+"内部预热之后。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile-start-after-requests <count>` | Disabled | Start after this "
+"many successful formal requests complete. Mutually exclusive with "
+"`--profile-start-after`. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `--profile-start-after-requests <count>` | 禁用 | 在完成指定数量的成功正式请求后开始。与 "
+"`--profile-start-after` 互斥。 |"
+
+msgid "| `--profile-duration <seconds>` | `8` | Requested capture duration. |"
+msgstr "| `--profile-duration <seconds>` | `8` | 请求的采集时长。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile-output <mode>` | `parsed` | Publish raw and parsed archives, or"
+" use `raw` for raw archives only. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `--profile-output <mode>` | `parsed` | 发布原始和解析后的归档，或使用 `raw` 仅发布原始归档。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile-with-stack` | Disabled | Collect stack/module attribution with "
+"additional overhead. |"
+msgstr "| `--profile-with-stack` | 禁用 | 采集堆栈/模块归属信息，会带来额外开销。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"The 60-second default applies when neither start option is specified. Profiling\n"
+"can reduce throughput and increase latency enough to fail performance baselines.\n"
+"Download the `profile-artifact-<key>` GitHub Artifact for manifests and archive\n"
+"links. See [Profiling from PR Comments](../developer_guide/contribution/nightly_ci_test.md#profiling-from-pr-comments)\n"
+"for capture-window selection, downloads, and troubleshooting."
+msgstr ""
+"当两个启动选项均未指定时，默认使用 60 秒。性能分析可能降低吞吐量并增加延迟，足以导致性能基线不达标。请下载 `profile-"
+"artifact-<key>` GitHub Artifact 以获取清单和归档链接。有关采集窗口选择、下载和故障排查，请参见[从 PR "
+"评论进行性能分析](../developer_guide/contribution/nightly_ci_test.md#profiling-from-"
+"pr-comments)。"
