+msgid "## Release Notes"
+msgstr "## 发布说明"
+
+msgid ""
+"If users can notice your change, include a release note fragment in the same PR:\n"
+"`release_notes/fragments/<PR number>.yaml`. This covers new model, hardware, or operator\n"
+"support, new features, changes to user-facing APIs, parameters, or configuration, behavior\n"
+"or default changes, dependency and toolchain updates, performance improvements, and\n"
+"important bug fixes. Internal changes, such as refactors, tests, CI, tooling, and\n"
+"documentation edits, do not need a fragment."
+msgstr ""
+"如果用户能够感知到你的改动，请在同一 PR 中包含一个发布说明片段：\n"
+"`release_notes/fragments/<PR number>.yaml`。这涵盖新模型、硬件或算子支持，新功能，面向用户的 API、参数或配置变更，行为或默认值变更，依赖与工具链更新，性能改进，以及重要的缺陷修复。内部改动（例如重构、测试、CI、工具和文档编辑）无需添加片段。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The fragment is reviewed together with the code. When unsure whether a fragment is needed,\n"
+"add one: extra entries can be dropped by the release manager at release time, while a missing\n"
+"entry is hard to recover later. See `release_notes/README.md` in the repository root for the\n"
+"principles, the format, and the template."
+msgstr ""
+"该片段将与代码一同评审。当不确定是否需要添加片段时，请添加一个：多余的条目可以在发布时由发布经理删除，而缺失的条目事后很难补救。有关原则、格式和模板，请参阅仓库根目录下的"
+" `release_notes/README.md`。"
