 msgid "Run the MLA, GQA and SFA context-parallel tests on A3-560T:"
 msgstr "在 A3-560T 上运行 MLA、GQA 和 SFA 上下文并行测试："
+
+msgid "## AISBench Output Artifacts"
+msgstr "## AISBench 输出产物"
+
+msgid ""
+"YAML-driven nightly tests upload the complete AISBench `outputs/` directory to\n"
+"the dispatched workflow run's **Artifacts** section, for all YAML-driven runs.\n"
+"Look for `aisbench-outputs-<scene>-<job>-<run-id>-<attempt>`. It contains the experiments\n"
+"from that test container, including configuration snapshots, logs, performance\n"
+"details, and reports produced by AISBench. Multiple benchmark experiments retain\n"
+"their original directory structure:"
+msgstr ""
+"YAML 驱动的 nightly 测试会将完整的 AISBench `outputs/` 目录上传到所调度工作流运行的 **Artifacts** "
+"区域，适用于所有 YAML 驱动的运行。请查找 `aisbench-outputs-<scene>-<job>-<run-"
+"id>-<attempt>`。它包含来自该测试容器的实验，包括配置快照、日志、性能详情以及 AISBench "
+"生成的报告。多个基准测试实验会保留其原始目录结构："
+
+msgid ""
+"Multi-node tests preserve outputs on shared storage after pytest finishes and\n"
+"before AOP reruns or Pod deletion. Only nodes that produced outputs appear in the\n"
+"artifact. Upload is attempted even when a benchmark or baseline check fails;\n"
+"files already generated are retained. A cancelled job or lost runner/Pod may\n"
+"prevent collection. These artifacts have a seven-day retention period and are\n"
+"separate from benchmark summary JSON."
+msgstr ""
+"多节点测试会在 pytest 结束后、AOP 重新运行或 Pod "
+"删除之前，将输出保留在共享存储上。只有产生了输出的节点才会出现在产物中。即使基准测试或基线检查失败，也会尝试上传；已生成的文件会被保留。作业被取消或 "
+"runner/Pod 丢失可能会导致无法收集。这些产物的保留期为七天，并且与基准测试摘要 JSON 相互独立。"
+
+msgid "## Profiling from PR Comments"
+msgstr "## 通过 PR 评论进行性能分析"
+
+msgid "### Overview"
+msgstr "### 概述"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use `/nightly --profile` to capture Ascend PyTorch Profiler data during selected\n"
+"YAML-driven AISBench performance benchmarks. Raw traces are uploaded to OBS;\n"
+"offline CPU jobs can parse them and publish per-rank results. A GitHub Artifact\n"
+"contains manifests, confirmed download links, and a download script."
+msgstr ""
+"使用 `/nightly --profile` 在选定的 YAML 驱动 AISBench 性能基准测试期间采集昇腾 PyTorch Profiler "
+"数据。原始 trace 会上传到 OBS；离线 CPU 作业可以解析这些数据并发布各 rank 的结果。GitHub Artifact "
+"包含清单、已确认的下载链接以及下载脚本。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This section describes the PR comment interface. Profiling is supported by the\n"
+"`/nightly` command for YAML-driven AISBench performance benchmarks; it does not\n"
+"add capture to arbitrary pytest tests or accuracy benchmarks. `/weekly --profile`\n"
+"is not supported."
+msgstr ""
+"本节介绍 PR 评论接口。`/nightly` 命令支持对 YAML 驱动的 AISBench 性能基准测试进行性能分析；它不会为任意 pytest "
+"测试或精度基准测试添加采集。不支持 `/weekly --profile`。"
+
+msgid "### Important Notes"
+msgstr "### 重要说明"
+
+msgid "!!! warning \"Profiling affects benchmark performance\""
+msgstr "!!! warning \"性能分析会影响基准测试性能\""
+
+msgid ""
+"Active profiling consumes resources, and stopping the profiler can take\n"
+"    additional time. Throughput can decrease and latency can increase enough to\n"
+"    fail the existing performance baseline. Baseline checks remain enabled.\n"
+"    Use results from a comparable run without profiling for performance comparisons. Check the\n"
+"    benchmark verdict and the profiling manifest independently: a baseline failure\n"
+"    can still leave useful profiling artifacts."
+msgstr ""
+"启用性能分析会消耗资源，停止 profiler "
+"可能需要额外时间。吞吐量可能下降、延迟可能上升，足以导致现有性能基线检查失败。基线检查仍保持启用。进行性能比较时，请使用未启用性能分析的可比运行的结果。请分别查看基准测试结论和性能分析清单：基线检查失败仍可能留下有用的性能分析产物。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- Capture covers all serving instances recorded for the selected benchmark.\n"
+"  There is no node or rank selection option. With internal DP, one API endpoint\n"
+"  controls its backend engines, including engines on headless nodes. In P/D\n"
+"  deployments, the separate serving groups are controlled through their own endpoints.\n"
+"- Start with a short capture and leave stack collection disabled unless it is\n"
+"  needed. Trace size and memory use depend on the model, worker count, workload,\n"
+"  and capture duration. The workflow does not impose a fixed disk-space budget;\n"
+"  resource exhaustion is reported as a failure.\n"
+"- Failures that prevent an enabled profiling capture, upload, or parse from\n"
+"  completing are reported as errors.\n"
+"- `--profile-duration` is the requested capture interval. It does not include all\n"
+"  start/stop, compression, transfer, or offline parsing time."
+msgstr ""
+"- 采集范围涵盖所选基准测试记录的所有服务实例。没有节点或 rank 选择选项。在内部 DP 模式下，一个 API 端点控制其后端引擎，包括无头节点上的引擎。在 P/D 部署中，各独立服务组通过各自的端点进行控制。\n"
+"- 请先进行短时间采集，除非确有需要，否则保持栈收集处于禁用状态。Trace 大小和内存占用取决于模型、worker 数量、工作负载以及采集时长。该工作流不设定固定的磁盘空间预算；资源耗尽会作为失败上报。\n"
+"- 导致已启用的性能分析采集、上传或解析无法完成的失败会作为错误上报。\n"
+"- `--profile-duration` 是请求的采集时间区间。它不包含全部启动/停止、压缩、传输或离线解析时间。"
+
+msgid "### Quick Start"
+msgstr "### 快速开始"
+
+msgid ""
+"Inspect a previous successful scheduled nightly or PR-triggered run with comparable\n"
+"hardware, deployment, and workload settings. Use its AISBench timings or a\n"
+"steady-state report, when available, to choose a capture window. If no suitable\n"
+"reference exists, trigger a run without profiling:"
+msgstr ""
+"请查看一次此前成功的、硬件、部署和工作负载设置可比的定时 nightly 运行或 PR 触发的运行。使用其 AISBench "
+"计时数据或稳态报告（如有）来选择采集窗口。如果不存在合适的参考，请先触发一次不启用性能分析的运行："
+
+msgid ""
+"Choose `--profile-start-after` and `--profile-duration` from the report. The\n"
+"following example collects the `perf` benchmark with a 60-second offset and an\n"
+"eight-second capture. Adjust both values to fit the desired window; the start\n"
+"can be earlier or later than the 60-second default:"
+msgstr ""
+"根据报告选择 `--profile-start-after` 和 `--profile-duration`。以下示例以 60 秒偏移和 8 "
+"秒采集时长来采集 `perf` 基准测试。请调整这两个值以适配所需的窗口；起始时间可以早于或晚于默认的 60 秒："
+
+msgid ""
+"The test name and `perf` key in this example come from the nightly matrix and its\n"
+"[model YAML](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/tests/e2e/cases/models/configs/DeepSeek/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-W8A8-A3.yaml).\n"
+"Choose the corresponding names from your PR when testing another configuration."
+msgstr ""
+"本示例中的测试名称和 `perf` 键来自 nightly 矩阵及其[模型 YAML](https://github.com/vllm-"
+"project/vllm-"
+"ascend/blob/main/tests/e2e/cases/models/configs/DeepSeek/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-W8A8-A3.yaml)。在测试其他配置时，请从你的"
+" PR 中选择相应的名称。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Wait for the capture job and its `Plan`, `Parse / node-N`, and `Finalize` jobs.\n"
+"In the workflow run's **Artifacts** section, download `profile-artifact-<key>`\n"
+"and extract it into `./profile_artifact`. Download the parsed archives with:"
+msgstr ""
+"等待采集作业及其 `Plan`、`Parse / node-N` 和 `Finalize` 作业完成。在工作流运行的 **Artifacts** "
+"区域中，下载 `profile-artifact-<key>` 并将其解压到 "
+"`./profile_artifact`。使用以下命令下载解析后的归档文件："
+
+msgid ""
+"The **Profiling summary** step in `Finalize` also contains grouped links and\n"
+"download commands. For raw-only collection, add `--profile-output raw`; no offline\n"
+"parse jobs are needed, and the summary is printed in the capture job."
+msgstr ""
+"`Finalize` 中的 **Profiling summary** 步骤还包含分组链接和下载命令。若仅需采集原始数据，请添加 `--profile-"
+"output raw`；此时无需离线解析作业，摘要会在采集作业中打印。"
+
+msgid "### Select Tests and Benchmarks"
+msgstr "### 选择测试和基准测试"
+
+msgid "There are three distinct names:"
+msgstr "共有三种不同的名称："
+
+msgid "| Name | Source | Example |"
+msgstr "| 名称 | 来源 | 示例 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Nightly test name | `name` in "
+"`.github/workflows/configs/nightly_config.yaml` | "
+"`DeepSeek-V4-Flash-W8A8-A3` |"
+msgstr ""
+"| Nightly 测试名称 | `.github/workflows/configs/nightly_config.yaml` 中的 `name` |"
+" `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-W8A8-A3` |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Benchmark name | Key under `benchmarks:` in the model YAML | `perf` |"
+msgstr "| 基准测试名称 | 模型 YAML 中 `benchmarks:` 下的键 | `perf` |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Benchmark artifact name | Generated from the YAML test configuration name "
+"and benchmark name | `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-W8A8-A3__perf` |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 基准测试产物名称 | 由 YAML 测试配置名称和基准测试名称生成 | `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-W8A8-A3__perf` |"
+
+msgid "For example, the relevant part of a model YAML can look like this:"
+msgstr "例如，模型 YAML 的相关部分可能如下所示："
+
+msgid ""
+"`--profile-benchmark-names perf` selects `perf` for capture. It does not change\n"
+"which benchmarks the YAML test executes: accuracy checks and other configured\n"
+"benchmarks still run. Selection uses exact benchmark keys; use a comma-separated\n"
+"list without spaces to select several, such as `perf_TPOT20,perf_TPOT50`.\n"
+"These names must exist in the selected model configurations."
+msgstr ""
+"`--profile-benchmark-names perf` 选择 `perf` 进行采集。它不会改变 YAML "
+"测试执行的基准测试：精度检查和其他已配置的基准测试仍会运行。选择使用精确的基准测试键；如需选择多个，请使用不带空格的逗号分隔列表，例如 "
+"`perf_TPOT20,perf_TPOT50`。这些名称必须存在于所选模型配置中。"
+
+msgid ""
+"AISBench's internal warmup is excluded from capture timing. A separate\n"
+"YAML benchmark named `warmup` is still an ordinary benchmark: if its `case_type`\n"
+"is `performance`, the default selection includes it. Select the intended benchmark\n"
+"keys explicitly when such a setup benchmark should run without capture."
+msgstr ""
+"AISBench 内部的 warmup 不计入采集计时。名为 `warmup` 的独立 YAML 基准测试仍然是普通基准测试：如果其 "
+"`case_type` 为 `performance`，默认选择会包含它。当此类准备性基准测试应在不采集的情况下运行时，请显式选择所需的基准测试键。"
+
+msgid "### Profiling Options"
+msgstr "### 性能分析选项"
+
+msgid "| Parameter | Default | Meaning |"
+msgstr "| 参数 | 默认值 | 含义 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile` | Disabled | Enable collection for selected performance "
+"benchmarks. Other profiling options alone do not enable it. |"
+msgstr "| `--profile` | 禁用 | 为选定的性能基准启用采集。仅设置其他性能分析选项不会启用采集。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile-start-after <seconds>` | `60` when neither trigger is specified"
+" | Delay from the first formal AISBench request, excluding internal warmup. "
+"Accepts a non-negative integer. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `--profile-start-after <seconds>` | 未指定任何触发条件时为 `60` | 从第一个正式 AISBench "
+"请求开始计算的延迟，不包含内部预热。接受非负整数。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile-start-after-requests <count>` | Disabled | Start after this "
+"many successful formal requests complete, summed across AISBench workers. "
+"Excludes warmup and failed requests. Accepts a positive integer. Mutually "
+"exclusive with `--profile-start-after`. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `--profile-start-after-requests <count>` | 禁用 | 在完成指定数量的成功正式请求后开始，按所有 "
+"AISBench worker 汇总计算。不包含预热请求和失败请求。接受正整数。与 `--profile-start-after` 互斥。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile-duration <seconds>` | `8` | Requested capture duration after "
+"the start calls return. Accepts a positive integer. |"
+msgstr "| `--profile-duration <seconds>` | `8` | 启动调用返回后请求的采集时长。接受正整数。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile-output <mode>` | `parsed` | `parsed` uploads raw traces and "
+"runs offline parsing; `raw` uploads only raw traces and skips offline "
+"parsing. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `--profile-output <mode>` | `parsed` | `parsed` 会上传原始 trace 并执行离线解析；`raw` "
+"仅上传原始 trace 并跳过离线解析。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile-with-stack` | Disabled | Enable the profiler's stack/module "
+"attribution option. This can increase overhead and artifact size. |"
+msgstr "| `--profile-with-stack` | 禁用 | 启用性能分析器的栈/模块归属选项。这会增加开销和产物大小。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `--profile-benchmark-names <names>` | All performance benchmarks | Comma-"
+"separated YAML benchmark keys to capture. Does not filter which benchmarks "
+"execute. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `--profile-benchmark-names <names>` | 所有性能基准 | 要采集的 YAML "
+"基准键，以逗号分隔。不会筛选执行哪些基准。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Triggers apply independently to each selected benchmark. Omitting both start\n"
+"options uses 60 seconds from that benchmark's first formal request. Request-count\n"
+"mode does not also wait for the default 60-second offset. Capture duration always\n"
+"uses seconds."
+msgstr ""
+"触发条件独立应用于每个选定的基准。若两个启动选项都省略，则从该基准的第一个正式请求开始计算 60 秒。请求计数模式不会同时等待默认的 60 "
+"秒偏移。采集时长始终以秒为单位。"
+
+msgid "For a capture after 100 successful formal requests:"
+msgstr "要在 100 个成功正式请求后采集："
+
+msgid ""
+"Workers periodically publish AISBench's existing success counters outside the\n"
+"request path, and the controller polls their sum. Both intervals are one second,\n"
+"so capture can start roughly two seconds after the threshold is reached, plus\n"
+"scheduling and API overhead; the observed count may exceed the threshold. The\n"
+"manifest records `completed_requests` at the trigger and `actual_start_after`,\n"
+"the time of the start calls relative to the first formal request marker. Request-count mode\n"
+"is useful for workload progress, but long requests may produce no completions\n"
+"during a useful capture window; use the time trigger in that case."
+msgstr ""
+"worker 会在请求路径之外定期发布 AISBench 现有的成功计数器，控制器会轮询其总和。两个间隔均为 1 秒，因此采集可能在达到阈值后约 2 "
+"秒开始，再加上调度和 API 开销；观测到的计数可能超过阈值。manifest 会记录触发时的 `completed_requests` 以及 "
+"`actual_start_after`，即启动调用相对于第一个正式请求标记的时间。请求计数模式适用于跟踪工作负载进度，但长请求在有用的采集窗口内可能不会产生任何完成；这种情况下请使用时间触发。"
+
+msgid "For a raw-only capture with a different offset and duration:"
+msgstr "要使用不同的偏移和时长进行仅原始数据的采集："
+
+msgid "### Choose a Capture Window"
+msgstr "### 选择采集窗口"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use a successful reference run with complete request timings. Compare hardware,\n"
+"model, deployment, concurrency, request count, and prompt/output lengths. Existing\n"
+"scheduled nightly runs are suitable references; a fresh run is only needed when\n"
+"those settings have changed or no comparable result exists."
+msgstr ""
+"使用一次具有完整请求时序的成功参考运行。比较硬件、模型、部署、并发度、请求数量以及提示/输出长度。现有的定时 nightly "
+"运行是合适的参考；仅当这些设置发生变化或不存在可比结果时，才需要重新运行。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Choose a time or successful-request count after ramp-up and leave enough work for\n"
+"the full capture before drain. The default 60-second delay is adjustable. Long\n"
+"requests may have no completions during useful decode activity, so use a time\n"
+"trigger when a completion threshold would be too late."
+msgstr ""
+"在爬坡后选择时间或成功请求计数，并留出足够的工作量以在排空之前完成整个采集。默认的 60 秒延迟可调整。长请求在有用的 decode "
+"活动期间可能不会产生任何完成，因此当完成阈值会太晚时，请使用时间触发。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The controller uses a marker written before the first formal request and does\n"
+"not depend on plotting. If a steady-state report is available, its result-based\n"
+"request timestamps provide a reference, not an exact synchronization guarantee.\n"
+"Profiling itself can change workload timing; inspect the actual trace and capture\n"
+"status after the run."
+msgstr ""
+"控制器使用在第一个正式请求之前写入的标记，不依赖绘图。如果有稳态报告可用，其基于结果的请求时间戳可作为参考，但不保证精确同步。性能分析本身可能改变工作负载时序；运行后请检查实际"
+" trace 和采集状态。"
+
+msgid "### Follow the Workflow"
+msgstr "### 遵循工作流程"
+
+msgid ""
+"Each unique serving endpoint receives start and stop requests. Internal DP\n"
+"workers sharing an endpoint are controlled together. The benchmark's deployment\n"
+"snapshot records the endpoint, node index, and trace directory for each target."
+msgstr ""
+"每个唯一的服务端点都会收到启动和停止请求。共享同一端点的内部 DP worker 会一起控制。基准的部署快照会记录每个目标的端点、节点索引和 trace"
+" 目录。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Offline parsing runs after raw upload, on separate CPU jobs. Nodes can parse in\n"
+"parallel. Within each node, rank parsing overlaps with compression/upload of the\n"
+"previous rank, with at most one completed rank waiting for publication. The\n"
+"`Parse / node-N` job name refers to the source node, not to one particular DP rank."
+msgstr ""
+"离线解析在原始数据上传之后运行，使用独立的 CPU 作业。各节点可以并行解析。在每个节点内，某个 rank 的解析与上一个 rank "
+"的压缩/上传重叠进行，最多只有一个已完成的 rank 等待发布。`Parse / node-N` 作业名指的是源节点，而不是某个特定的 DP rank。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The workflow attempts artifact publication and finalization even after a test or\n"
+"parse failure. Cancellation, runner loss, or a failure before any artifact exists\n"
+"can still prevent publication. Check the final manifest for completeness."
+msgstr ""
+"即使测试或解析失败，工作流也会尝试发布产物并完成收尾。取消、runner 丢失或任何产物存在之前的失败仍可能阻止发布。请检查最终 manifest "
+"是否完整。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The capture job groups raw upload and index preparation under **Publish profiling\n"
+"data**. **Upload profiling index** and **Profiling summary** remain separate so\n"
+"index upload and download-link reporting can still run after publication errors.\n"
+"Finalize similarly groups result merging and index preparation under **Finalize\n"
+"profiling data**."
+msgstr ""
+"采集作业将原始数据上传和索引准备归入 **Publish profiling data**。**Upload profiling index** 和 "
+"**Profiling summary** 保持独立，以便在发布出错后仍能执行索引上传和下载链接报告。Finalize 同样将结果合并和索引准备归入 "
+"**Finalize profiling data**。"
+
+msgid "### Find and Download Artifacts"
+msgstr "### 查找并下载产物"
+
+msgid ""
+"Open the dispatched `Nightly-*` workflow run, then its **Artifacts** "
+"section:"
+msgstr "打开已分发的 `Nightly-*` 工作流运行，然后进入其 **Artifacts** 部分："
+
+msgid "| Artifact | Use |"
+msgstr "| 产物 | 用途 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `profile-artifact-<key>` | Final index with manifests, confirmed download "
+"links, and a download script. Start here. |"
+msgstr "| `profile-artifact-<key>` | 包含 manifest、已确认的下载链接和下载脚本的最终索引。从这里开始。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `profile-capture-<key>` | Intermediate raw index for parsed-mode runs. "
+"Useful while parsing is pending or if finalization cannot finish. |"
+msgstr "| `profile-capture-<key>` | parsed 模式运行的中间原始索引。在解析尚未完成或收尾无法完成时很有用。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `profile-shard-<key>-node-N` | Per-node parse status used by Finalize; "
+"useful for diagnosing a missing or failed shard. |"
+msgstr "| `profile-shard-<key>-node-N` | Finalize 使用的每节点解析状态；可用于诊断缺失或失败的分片。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"The key includes repository, run ID, run attempt, deployment scene, branch, and\n"
+"job identity. Match it to the test and run attempt being investigated. The\n"
+"index artifacts currently have a 90-day GitHub retention period. OBS data retention\n"
+"depends on the bucket's lifecycle policy and is separate from GitHub retention."
+msgstr ""
+"该 key 包含仓库、运行 ID、运行尝试、部署场景、分支和作业标识。请将其与正在调查的测试和运行尝试匹配。索引产物目前具有 90 天的 GitHub "
+"保留期。OBS 数据保留取决于桶的生命周期策略，与 GitHub 保留期相互独立。"
+
+msgid "Extract the final index into `profile_artifact/`:"
+msgstr "将最终索引解压到 `profile_artifact/`："
+
+msgid ""
+"`raw/` and `parsed/` contain download documents, not the large trace archives.\n"
+"The archives live in OBS. Raw-only runs omit `parsed/`.\n"
+"`profile_manifest.json` records requested settings, benchmark/target/rank status,\n"
+"errors, and archive locations. Each benchmark has its own `serve_manifest.json`\n"
+"snapshot so later deployments do not overwrite the topology associated with\n"
+"earlier captures. `summary.txt` is a readable overview of the same index."
+msgstr ""
+"`raw/` 和 `parsed/` 包含下载文档，而非大型 trace 归档文件。\n"
+"归档文件存放在 OBS 中。仅采集 raw 数据的运行不包含 `parsed/`。\n"
+"`profile_manifest.json` 记录请求的配置、benchmark/target/rank 状态、\n"
+"错误以及归档位置。每个 benchmark 都有自己的 `serve_manifest.json`\n"
+"快照，因此后续部署不会覆盖与更早采集关联的拓扑。`summary.txt` 是同一索引的可读概览。"
+
+msgid ""
+"With Bash and curl available, download all confirmed archives, or select a "
+"stage:"
+msgstr "在具备 Bash 和 curl 的环境中，下载所有已确认的归档文件，或选择某个阶段："
+
+msgid ""
+"The optional second argument is the destination; its default is\n"
+"`./profile-download`. The script preserves the `raw/` and `parsed/` archive paths,\n"
+"retries failed transfers, and downloads sequentially. It stops on an unsuccessful\n"
+"download; incomplete files keep a `.part` suffix. It does not extract archives.\n"
+"For an individual target or rank, use the link in its `downloads.md` entry."
+msgstr ""
+"可选的第二个参数是目标目录；其默认值为\n"
+"`./profile-download`。该脚本会保留 `raw/` 和 `parsed/` 归档路径，\n"
+"重试失败的传输，并按顺序下载。下载失败时脚本会停止；未完成的文件保留 `.part` 后缀。该脚本不会解压归档文件。\n"
+"如需下载单个 target 或 rank，请使用其 `downloads.md` 条目中的链接。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The **Profiling summary** step prints an overview, quick-download commands, and\n"
+"separate expandable **RAW download links** / **PARSED download links** groups.\n"
+"In parsed mode, look in `Finalize`; raw-only runs and capture publication failures\n"
+"also print a summary in the capture job when an index could be prepared. This log\n"
+"provides a second access path if the GitHub index upload fails."
+msgstr ""
+"**Profiling summary** 步骤会打印概览、快速下载命令，以及\n"
+"各自可展开的 **RAW download links** / **PARSED download links** 分组。\n"
+"在 parsed 模式下，请查看 `Finalize`；仅采集 raw 数据的运行以及采集发布失败时，\n"
+"只要能够生成索引，也会在采集任务中打印摘要。如果 GitHub 索引上传失败，\n"
+"该日志提供了第二条访问途径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The printed `obsutil cp ... -r -j=4` commands download a whole run's data with up\n"
+"to four concurrent files. They require OBS list/download permissions. The script\n"
+"and individual HTTPS links use the objects' existing read permissions; possession\n"
+"of an index does not grant additional access."
+msgstr ""
+"打印出的 `obsutil cp ... -r -j=4` 命令可下载整次运行的数据，最多\n"
+"支持四个并发文件。这些命令需要 OBS 的列举/下载权限。脚本\n"
+"和单个 HTTPS 链接使用对象已有的读取权限；拥有\n"
+"索引并不会授予额外访问权限。"
+
+msgid "### Inspect Profiling Results"
+msgstr "### 查看 Profiling 结果"
+
+msgid ""
+"Raw archives group traces by benchmark and serving target. Parsed archives are\n"
+"published per rank, so you can download just the ranks needed for analysis.\n"
+"Unpack an archive into a chosen directory:"
+msgstr ""
+"Raw 归档按 benchmark 和 serving target 对 trace 进行分组。Parsed 归档\n"
+"按 rank 发布，因此你可以只下载分析所需的 rank。\n"
+"将归档解压到指定目录："
+
+msgid ""
+"A parsed archive contains the rank's `ASCEND_PROFILER_OUTPUT/` directory and\n"
+"available profiler metadata. Typical contents include:"
+msgstr ""
+"Parsed 归档包含该 rank 的 `ASCEND_PROFILER_OUTPUT/` 目录以及\n"
+"可用的 profiler 元数据。典型内容包括："
+
+msgid "| File | Purpose |"
+msgstr "| 文件 | 用途 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `trace_view.json` | Timeline of CPU/NPU activity for inspection in "
+"MindStudio Insight. |"
+msgstr "| `trace_view.json` | CPU/NPU 活动时间线，可在 MindStudio Insight 中查看。 |"
+
+msgid "| `kernel_details.csv` | Detailed kernel execution records. |"
+msgstr "| `kernel_details.csv` | 详细的 kernel 执行记录。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `operator_details.csv` / `op_statistic.csv` | Operator details and "
+"aggregate statistics. |"
+msgstr "| `operator_details.csv` / `op_statistic.csv` | 算子详情和汇总统计。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `communication.json` / `communication_matrix.json` | Communication "
+"analysis, when produced by the profiler. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `communication.json` / `communication_matrix.json` | 通信分析（当 profiler 生成时）。"
+" |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `profiler_info*.json` / `profiler_metadata.json` | Capture metadata, when "
+"available. |"
+msgstr "| `profiler_info*.json` / `profiler_metadata.json` | 采集元数据（当可用时）。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Open `trace_view.json` with MindStudio Insight and select the relevant rank and\n"
+"time region. For the viewer and file descriptions, see\n"
+"[View Results](../performance_and_debug/service_profiling_guide.md#5-view-results).\n"
+"Available files depend on the profiler version and captured activity."
+msgstr ""
+"使用 MindStudio Insight 打开 `trace_view.json`，并选择相关的 rank 和\n"
+"时间区间。有关查看器和文件说明，请参见\n"
+"[查看结果](../performance_and_debug/service_profiling_guide.md#5-view-results)。\n"
+"可用文件取决于 profiler 版本和采集的活动。"
+
+msgid ""
+"If you downloaded raw data, or need to repeat analysis, unpack the raw archive\n"
+"and locate a `*_ascend_pt` directory. In an environment with a compatible\n"
+"Ascend PyTorch Profiler installation, analyze that directory:"
+msgstr ""
+"如果你下载了 raw 数据，或需要重复分析，请解压 raw 归档\n"
+"并找到 `*_ascend_pt` 目录。在安装了兼容\n"
+"Ascend PyTorch Profiler 的环境中，分析该目录："
+
+msgid ""
+"Use a compatible environment, preferably the capture job's image/software\n"
+"versions. Repeat for the required rank directories. The offline CI workflow uses\n"
+"this analysis API with its default process setting. See\n"
+"[Analyze Data](../performance_and_debug/service_profiling_guide.md#4-analyze-data)\n"
+"for the underlying service profiling workflow."
+msgstr ""
+"请使用兼容的环境，最好与采集任务的镜像/软件\n"
+"版本一致。对所需的 rank 目录重复此操作。离线 CI 工作流使用\n"
+"该分析 API 及其默认进程设置。有关底层的 service profiling 工作流，\n"
+"请参见[分析数据](../performance_and_debug/service_profiling_guide.md#4-analyze-data)。"
+
+msgid "### Profiling Troubleshooting"
+msgstr "### Profiling 故障排查"
+
+msgid "| Symptom | What to check or change |"
+msgstr "| 现象 | 需要检查或更改的内容 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Throughput drops or the baseline check fails | Compare against a separate "
+"run without profiling. Check profiling status independently; successful "
+"traces can still be useful. Shorten capture and leave stack collection off "
+"when possible. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 吞吐量下降或基线检查失败 | 与未进行 profiling 的单独运行进行对比。独立检查 profiling 状态；成功的 trace "
+"仍然可能有用。缩短采集时间，并尽可能关闭堆栈采集。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| No benchmarks were captured | Confirm `--profile` is present, the test "
+"uses the YAML/AISBench performance path, and selected names exactly match "
+"performance benchmark keys. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 未采集到任何 benchmark | 确认存在 `--profile`，测试使用 YAML/AISBench 性能路径，并且所选名称与性能 "
+"benchmark 键完全匹配。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `benchmark_ended_before_start` | The benchmark finished before its offset "
+"elapsed. Reduce `start_after` or increase the workload duration. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `benchmark_ended_before_start` | benchmark 在其偏移时间到达之前就已结束。减小 `start_after`"
+" 或增加工作负载持续时间。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `benchmark_ended_before_request_threshold` | Too few successful formal "
+"requests completed before the benchmark ended. Lower `start_after_requests`,"
+" increase the workload, or use a time trigger. This is an incomplete capture"
+" and fails profiling. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `benchmark_ended_before_request_threshold` | benchmark 结束前完成的成功正式请求太少。降低 "
+"`start_after_requests`、增加工作负载，或使用时间触发。这属于不完整的采集，会导致 profiling 失败。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Capture ends with `benchmark_ended` | The benchmark ended before the "
+"requested interval completed. Choose an earlier/shorter window or run more "
+"requests. This is an incomplete capture. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 采集以 `benchmark_ended` 结束 | benchmark "
+"在请求的区间完成之前就已结束。选择更早/更短的窗口，或运行更多请求。这属于不完整的采集。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Raw exists but parsed data is missing | In `raw` mode this is expected. "
+"Otherwise inspect Plan/Parse/Finalize and the manifest's per-target/per-rank"
+" errors; raw data can be downloaded for another analysis attempt. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 存在 raw 数据但缺少 parsed 数据 | 在 `raw` 模式下这是预期行为。否则请检查 Plan/Parse/Finalize 以及 "
+"manifest 中按 target/按 rank 的错误；可以下载 raw 数据以进行另一次分析尝试。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Manifest status is `partial` | Inspect benchmark, target, and rank errors."
+" Download links include confirmed uploads only and do not imply that all "
+"requested data was produced. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| Manifest 状态为 `partial` | 检查 benchmark、target 和 rank "
+"错误。下载链接仅包含已确认的上传，并不表示已生成所有请求的数据。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| One internal DP API port produces many rank traces | The endpoint controls"
+" multiple backend engines. Collection covers the recorded deployment, "
+"including headless nodes. |"
+msgstr "| 一个内部 DP API 端口产生大量 rank trace | 该端点控制多个后端引擎。采集覆盖所记录的部署，包括无头节点。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Storage or memory is exhausted | Shorten subsequent captures, leave stack "
+"collection off, and choose fewer benchmarks. Download only needed ranks; use"
+" a destination with enough space for archives and extracted data. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 存储或内存耗尽 | 缩短后续采集时间、关闭堆栈采集，并选择更少的 benchmark。仅下载所需的 "
+"rank；使用有足够空间容纳归档文件和已解压数据的目标目录。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Download returns an access error | Check object read permissions; "
+"`obsutil` recursive download also needs list permission. GitHub Artifact "
+"access alone does not grant OBS access. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 下载返回访问错误 | 检查对象读取权限；`obsutil` 递归下载还需要列举权限。仅拥有 GitHub Artifact 访问权限并不会授予 "
+"OBS 访问权限。 |"
