 msgid "### kv_port Configuration Guide"
 msgstr "### kv_port 配置指南"
 
@@ -722,3 +712,162 @@ msgid ""
 msgstr ""
 "增大此超时通常不会影响正常运行期间的推理精度或性能。如果 decoder（D）节点发生故障，而请求的 KV 缓存仍留在 prefiller（P）节点上且"
 " decoder 尚未接收，则更长的超时会延迟释放这些缓存。在释放之前，它们会持续占用 HBM，从而减少 P 节点上可用于其他请求的内存。"
+
+msgid ""
+"We can run the following scripts to launch a server on the prefiller/decoder"
+" node, respectively. Please note that each P/D node will occupy ports "
+"ranging from kv_port to kv_port + num_chips to initialize socket listeners. "
+"To avoid any issues, port conflicts should be prevented."
+msgstr ""
+"我们可以分别在预填充（prefiller）节点和解码（decoder）节点上运行以下脚本以启动服务。请注意，每个 P/D 节点将占用从 kv_port "
+"到 kv_port + num_chips 范围内的端口来初始化 socket 监听器。为避免出现问题，应防止端口冲突。"
+
+msgid "## D2RH Deployment on Atlas 850E (UBoE)"
+msgstr "## 在 Atlas 850E (UBoE) 上部署 D2RH"
+
+msgid ""
+"**Validation scope:** D2RH has only been validated with the Atlas 850E\n"
+"UBoE configuration shown below, using DeepSeek-V4-Flash. Other hardware,\n"
+"network types, and deployment configurations have not been validated."
+msgstr ""
+"**验证范围：** D2RH 仅使用 DeepSeek-V4-Flash 在如下所示的 Atlas 850E\n"
+"UBoE 配置下进行了验证。其他硬件、网络类型和部署配置尚未经过验证。"
+
+msgid ""
+"D2RH stages KV cache in the Decode node's host memory before loading it into\n"
+"HBM. See the [D2RH workflow](../../developer_guide/Design_Documents/disaggregated_prefill.md#mooncake-d2rh-connector)\n"
+"for the transfer sequence and cache-hit behavior."
+msgstr ""
+"D2RH 会先将 KV cache 暂存到 Decode 节点的主机内存中，然后再加载到\n"
+"HBM。有关传输顺序和缓存命中行为，请参阅 [D2RH 工作流程](../../developer_guide/Design_Documents/disaggregated_prefill.md#mooncake-d2rh-connector)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"**Memory limitation:** D2RH currently registers a pinned host KV cache on each\n"
+"Decode worker with the same capacity as its device KV cache, plus alignment\n"
+"overhead. This mirrors the KV cache, not the device's total HBM capacity.\n"
+"Ensure that available host RAM and container memory limits cover the combined\n"
+"allocation of all local Decode ranks, with headroom for model loading and other\n"
+"process memory."
+msgstr ""
+"**内存限制：** D2RH 目前会在每个 Decode worker 上注册一个固定（pinned）主机 KV cache，其容量与其设备 KV "
+"cache 相同，另加对齐开销。它镜像的是 KV cache，而不是设备的总 HBM 容量。请确保可用的主机 RAM 和容器内存限制能够覆盖所有本地 "
+"Decode rank 的合计分配量，并为模型加载和其他进程内存预留余量。"
+
+msgid "**1. Start P and D in separate terminals on their respective nodes.**"
+msgstr "**1. 在各自节点上的独立终端中分别启动 P 和 D。**"
+
+msgid ""
+"Replace the example IPs, interface names, and model paths with your deployment\n"
+"values. Run each script on its corresponding node."
+msgstr "请将示例中的 IP、接口名称和模型路径替换为你的部署值。在各自对应的节点上运行每个脚本。"
+
+msgid "On P:"
+msgstr "在 P 上："
+
+msgid "On D:"
+msgstr "在 D 上："
+
+msgid ""
+"The scripts enable prefix caching on both sides, keep the hybrid KV cache\n"
+"manager enabled, and set\n"
+"`ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG='{\"comm_resource_config.protocol_desc\":[\"uboe:device\"]}'`.\n"
+"They use FP8 indexer cache on Atlas 850E, not the INT8 indexer setting from the\n"
+"A2/A3 examples; see the [W4A4C8 FAQ](../models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md#q-how-do-the-w4a4c8-ultra-low-bit-quantized-weights-preserve-accuracy).\n"
+"P uses eager execution and D uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graphs."
+msgstr ""
+"这些脚本在两侧均启用前缀缓存，保持混合 KV cache\n"
+"管理器启用，并设置\n"
+"`ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG='{\"comm_resource_config.protocol_desc\":[\"uboe:device\"]}'`。\n"
+"在 Atlas 850E 上它们使用 FP8 indexer cache，而不是 A2/A3 示例中的 INT8 indexer 设置；请参阅 [W4A4C8 FAQ](../models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md#q-how-do-the-w4a4c8-ultra-low-bit-quantized-weights-preserve-accuracy)。\n"
+"P 使用 eager 执行，D 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The context limit is 133120 tokens, enough for 128K input plus 1K output, including\n"
+"any prompt-template tokens within that limit.\n"
+"Adjust `--gpu-memory-utilization` directly if needed.\n"
+"Reducing it reduces available KV capacity and can reduce D's staging allocation;\n"
+"recheck both host memory and maximum request capacity after changing it."
+msgstr ""
+"上下文限制为 133120 个 token，足以容纳 128K 输入加 1K 输出，包括该限制内的任何提示模板 token。\n"
+"如有需要，可直接调整 `--gpu-memory-utilization`。\n"
+"降低它会减少可用的 KV 容量，并可能减少 D 的暂存分配量；\n"
+"更改后请重新检查主机内存和最大请求容量。"
+
+msgid ""
+"HTTP ports are 8100 (P) and 8200 (D); DP RPC ports are 12321 and 12322, and\n"
+"`kv_port` bases are 36010 and 36020. The Decode script explicitly sets two\n"
+"additional TCP/ZMQ control-port bases in `kv_connector_extra_config`:"
+msgstr ""
+"HTTP 端口为 8100 (P) 和 8200 (D)；DP RPC 端口为 12321 和 12322，\n"
+"`kv_port` 基址为 36010 和 36020。Decode 脚本在 `kv_connector_extra_config` 中显式设置了两个\n"
+"额外的 TCP/ZMQ 控制端口基址："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `d2rh_zmq_port` (default: `38100`): Each D worker listens for `START_PULL`\n"
+"  requests from its local scheduler. These requests trigger staging of the\n"
+"  required KV cache into D host memory, reusing valid host-cache entries when\n"
+"  available. This port carries control messages, not the KV data itself.\n"
+"- `d2rh_scheduler_ready_port` (default: `38200`): Each D scheduler listens for\n"
+"  worker notifications that host staging is ready. Once the required workers\n"
+"  report readiness, the request can proceed to device-block allocation and\n"
+"  H2D loading. This notification does not mean that H2D or decoding has finished."
+msgstr ""
+"- `d2rh_zmq_port`（默认值：`38100`）：每个 D worker 监听来自其本地调度器的 `START_PULL`\n"
+"  请求。这些请求会触发将所需的 KV cache 暂存到 D 主机内存，并在可用时\n"
+"  复用有效的主机缓存条目。此端口承载控制消息，而不是 KV 数据本身。\n"
+"- `d2rh_scheduler_ready_port`（默认值：`38200`）：每个 D 调度器监听\n"
+"  worker 发出的主机暂存已就绪通知。一旦所需的 worker 报告就绪，请求即可继续进入设备块分配和\n"
+"  H2D 加载。此通知并不意味着 H2D 或解码已完成。"
+
+msgid ""
+"These are base ports, not single ports shared by all ranks. For this\n"
+"DP4/TP1/PP1 deployment, D uses `38100-38103` for pull requests and\n"
+"`38200-38203` for scheduler-ready notifications, with one port per DP rank in\n"
+"each range. Other parallelism layouts introduce additional rank offsets;\n"
+"reserve the full ranges for the deployment. Both settings are D-side controls\n"
+"and do not need to be duplicated in the P script."
+msgstr ""
+"这些是基址端口，而不是所有 rank 共享的单一端口。对于此\n"
+"DP4/TP1/PP1 部署，D 使用 `38100-38103` 处理拉取请求，\n"
+"使用 `38200-38203` 处理调度器就绪通知，每个范围内每个 DP rank 对应一个端口。其他并行布局会引入额外的 rank 偏移；\n"
+"请为部署预留完整范围。这两项设置均为 D 侧控制项，\n"
+"无需在 P 脚本中重复设置。"
+
+msgid ""
+"These ports are independent of `kv_port`, which is still used for Mooncake\n"
+"handshake metadata and transfer-completion signaling. Changing `kv_port` does\n"
+"not change either D2RH control-port base. Mooncake TransferEngine RPC and\n"
+"UBoE/HCCL communication also have separate network requirements."
+msgstr ""
+"这些端口独立于 `kv_port`，后者仍用于 Mooncake\n"
+"握手元数据和传输完成信令。更改 `kv_port` 不会\n"
+"改变任何一个 D2RH 控制端口基址。Mooncake TransferEngine RPC 和\n"
+"UBoE/HCCL 通信也有各自的网络要求。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For multiple D instances sharing a host network, assign non-overlapping ranges\n"
+"to both settings and avoid conflicts with HTTP, DP RPC, `kv_port`, and other\n"
+"services. For example, a second DP4/TP1/PP1 instance can use bases `39100` and\n"
+"`39200` if `39100-39103` and `39200-39203` are free. Configure the bases once in\n"
+"that instance's D launch command; rank offsets are added automatically. Ensure\n"
+"that D schedulers and workers can reach the bound D-node IP and these TCP ports."
+msgstr ""
+"对于共享主机网络的多个 D 实例，请为这两项设置分配互不重叠的范围，\n"
+"并避免与 HTTP、DP RPC、`kv_port` 及其他服务冲突。例如，如果 `39100-39103` 和 `39200-39203` 空闲，\n"
+"第二个 DP4/TP1/PP1 实例可以使用基址 `39100` 和\n"
+"`39200`。在该实例的 D 启动命令中配置一次基址即可；rank 偏移会自动添加。请确保\n"
+"D 调度器和 worker 能够访问绑定的 D 节点 IP 及这些 TCP 端口。"
+
+msgid "**2. Check both services, then start the proxy.**"
+msgstr "**2. 检查两个服务，然后启动代理。**"
+
+msgid "On a host that can reach both nodes, from the repository root:"
+msgstr "在能够访问两个节点的主机上，从仓库根目录执行："
+
+msgid ""
+"The proxy points at each node's single API endpoint; the server distributes\n"
+"requests across its local DP ranks. Do not also run `launch_online_dp.py` for\n"
+"this example. Keep these unauthenticated example endpoints on a trusted network."
+msgstr ""
+"代理指向每个节点的单一 API 端点；服务器会在其本地 DP rank 之间分发\n"
+"请求。此示例中不要同时运行 `launch_online_dp.py`。请将这些未认证的示例端点保持在可信网络上。"
