-"upstream vLLM revision dated September 11, 2026 or later. Development builds\n"
-"use the verified main revision recorded in `.github/vllm-main-verified.commit`.\n"
-"Release builds use the tag recorded in `.github/vllm-release-tag.commit`\n"
-"(currently v0.31.0). These are separate supported upstream revisions."
+"DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash is supported in **vLLM Ascend v0.30.0rc1 and later**. This guide uses **vLLM Ascend\n"
+"v0.30.0rc2** as its documentation and model-validation baseline. To use the\n"
+"latest features, use the latest supported vLLM Ascend version."
 msgstr ""
-"DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 支持需要 vLLM Ascend 的 `main` 分支以及日期为 2026 年 9 月 11 日或之后的上游 "
