+msgid "#### 5.2.1.5 Key Parameter Descriptions"
+msgstr "#### 5.2.1.5 关键参数说明"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=36000` gives every Prefill and Decode engine up\n"
+"      to 36,000 seconds to finish startup. This includes weight loading and Decode\n"
+"      graph preparation.\n"
+"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly selects model runner V1 on both\n"
+"      Prefill and Decode. Keep this value at `0` because DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash\n"
+"      currently does not support model runner V2 on Ascend.\n"
+"    - `--data-parallel-size` and `--tensor-parallel-size` define DP4/TP4 on\n"
+"      Prefill and DP8/TP2 on Decode. Their product must be 16 on each A3 node.\n"
+"    - `--data-parallel-address` and `--data-parallel-rpc-port` coordinate DP ranks\n"
+"      within one role. Prefill and Decode use their respective node IPs; port\n"
+"      `12321` can be reused because the roles run on different hosts.\n"
+"    - `--vllm-start-port 7100` assigns API ports `7100-7103` on Prefill and\n"
+"      `7100-7107` on Decode. These endpoints must be reachable by the PD proxy.\n"
+"    - Both roles use `--max-model-len 1048576`. Prefill uses\n"
+"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` and `--max-num-seqs 16` to favor prompt\n"
+"      throughput, while Decode uses `512` and `72` respectively to favor decode\n"
+"      concurrency. Tune these role-specific scheduler limits independently.\n"
+"    - `MooncakeHybridConnector` transfers KV cache between the two roles.\n"
+"      `kv_role` must be `kv_producer` on Prefill and `kv_consumer` on Decode;\n"
+"      `kv_port` must be reachable and must not conflict with another service.\n"
+"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` must match the actual global layouts on both\n"
+"      sides: Prefill DP4/TP4 and Decode DP8/TP2. Keep the values identical in the\n"
+"      Prefill and Decode commands.\n"
+"    - Both roles use DSpark with five speculative tokens. Prefill runs the target\n"
+"      model in eager mode. Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` for the target model,\n"
+"      while `enforce_eager` inside `--speculative-config` applies to the Decode\n"
+"      draft model.\n"
+"    - `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'` keeps the\n"
+"      Engram table in host memory and lets local DP ranks share the host-memory\n"
+"      allocation. `dp_shared_memory` is required on A3 because the model's 24\n"
+"      Engram heads cannot be evenly divided across 16 logical devices. Both A3\n"
+"      containers use `--ipc=host` so the local DP ranks can share the allocation.\n"
+"    - `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` captures the\n"
+"      Decode path while Prefill remains outside the captured graph.\n"
+"    - Prefix caching is enabled only on Prefill. Decode disables it and enables\n"
+"      `recompute_scheduler_enable` so Prefill can recompute unavailable KV cache.\n"
+"    - Prefill uses the following `--additional-config` options:"
+msgstr ""
+"- `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=36000` 为每个 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎提供最多\n"
+"      36,000 秒的启动时间。这包括权重加载和 Decode\n"
+"      图准备。\n"
+"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 在 Prefill 和 Decode 上显式选择 model runner V1。\n"
+"      请将此值保持为 `0`，因为 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash\n"
+"      目前在昇腾上不支持 model runner V2。\n"
+"    - `--data-parallel-size` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size` 在\n"
+"      Prefill 上定义 DP4/TP4，在 Decode 上定义 DP8/TP2。它们的乘积在每个 A3 节点上必须为 16。\n"
+"    - `--data-parallel-address` 和 `--data-parallel-rpc-port` 协调同一角色内的 DP rank。\n"
+"      Prefill 和 Decode 使用各自的节点 IP；端口\n"
+"      `12321` 可以复用，因为两个角色运行在不同主机上。\n"
+"    - `--vllm-start-port 7100` 在 Prefill 上分配 API 端口 `7100-7103`，在 Decode 上\n"
+"      分配 `7100-7107`。这些端点必须能被 PD 代理访问。\n"
+"    - 两个角色都使用 `--max-model-len 1048576`。Prefill 使用\n"
+"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` 和 `--max-num-seqs 16` 以提升提示\n"
+"      吞吐量，而 Decode 分别使用 `512` 和 `72` 以提升解码\n"
+"      并发度。请独立调整这些角色特定的调度器限制。\n"
+"    - `MooncakeHybridConnector` 在两个角色之间传输 KV 缓存。\n"
+"      `kv_role` 在 Prefill 上必须为 `kv_producer`，在 Decode 上必须为 `kv_consumer`；\n"
+"      `kv_port` 必须可访问，且不得与其他服务冲突。\n"
+"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` 必须与两侧的实际全局布局匹配：\n"
+"      Prefill DP4/TP4 和 Decode DP8/TP2。请保持 Prefill 和 Decode 命令中的\n"
+"      值一致。\n"
+"    - 两个角色都使用 DSpark，带五个推测 token。Prefill 以 eager 模式运行目标\n"
+"      模型。Decode 对目标模型使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`，\n"
+"      而 `--speculative-config` 中的 `enforce_eager` 应用于 Decode\n"
+"      草稿模型。\n"
+"    - `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'` 将\n"
+"      Engram 表保留在主机内存中，并让本地 DP rank 共享主机内存\n"
+"      分配。A3 上需要 `dp_shared_memory`，因为模型的 24\n"
+"      个 Engram 头无法在 16 个逻辑设备上均匀划分。两个 A3\n"
+"      容器都使用 `--ipc=host`，以便本地 DP rank 可以共享该分配。\n"
+"    - `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 捕获\n"
+"      Decode 路径，而 Prefill 保持在捕获图之外。\n"
+"    - 前缀缓存仅在 Prefill 上启用。Decode 禁用它并启用\n"
+"      `recompute_scheduler_enable`，以便 Prefill 可以重新计算不可用的 KV 缓存。\n"
+"    - Prefill 使用以下 `--additional-config` 选项："
+
+msgid ""
+"`HCCL_IF_IP` and the socket interface variables must select the same high-speed\n"
+"      service network used by the configured node IPs. `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` is `1024` on\n"
+"      Prefill and `1800` on Decode; retain these role-specific values unless another\n"
+"      setting has been validated. The DP RPC, engine, Mooncake, and proxy ports must\n"
+"      be allowed by the host firewall.\n"
+"      Wait until every engine finishes loading weights and Decode finishes graph\n"
+"      capture. A successful startup includes output similar to:"
+msgstr ""
+"`HCCL_IF_IP` 和套接字接口变量必须选择与所配置节点 IP 相同的\n"
+"      高速服务网络。`HCCL_BUFFSIZE` 在 Prefill 上为 `1024`，在 Decode 上为 `1800`；\n"
+"      除非已验证其他设置，否则请保留这些角色特定的值。DP RPC、引擎、Mooncake 和代理端口必须\n"
+"      被主机防火墙允许。\n"
+"      等待每个引擎完成权重加载且 Decode 完成图\n"
+"      捕获。成功启动包含类似以下的输出："
+
+msgid ""
+"This example uses four Atlas 800 A2 servers. The Prefill role runs four DP\n"
+"    ranks with TP4 (DP4/TP4) across two servers: the first Prefill server hosts\n"
+"    DP ranks 0-1 and the second Prefill server hosts DP ranks 2-3. The Decode\n"
+"    role runs eight DP ranks with TP2 (DP8/TP2) across the other two servers:\n"
+"    the first Decode server hosts DP ranks 0-3 and the second Decode server\n"
+"    hosts DP ranks 4-7. Each layout consumes all 8 logical devices on its\n"
+"    server. Mooncake transfers KV cache from the Prefill engines to the Decode\n"
+"    engines."
+msgstr ""
+"本示例使用四台 Atlas 800 A2 服务器。Prefill 角色跨两台服务器运行四个 DP\n"
+"    rank，采用 TP4（DP4/TP4）：第一台 Prefill 服务器承载\n"
+"    DP rank 0-1，第二台 Prefill 服务器承载 DP rank 2-3。Decode\n"
+"    角色跨另外两台服务器运行八个 DP rank，采用 TP2（DP8/TP2）：\n"
+"    第一台 Decode 服务器承载 DP rank 0-3，第二台 Decode 服务器\n"
+"    承载 DP rank 4-7。每种布局都会占用其\n"
+"    服务器上的全部 8 个逻辑设备。Mooncake 将 KV 缓存从 Prefill 引擎传输到 Decode\n"
+"    引擎。"
+
+msgid "Example IP mapping used below:"
+msgstr "下面使用的示例 IP 映射："
+
+msgid "| Role | Server | Local DP ranks | Devices per rank | Engine ports |"
+msgstr "| 角色 | 服务器 | 本地 DP rank | 每个 rank 的设备数 | 引擎端口 |"
+
+msgid "#### 5.2.2.1 Prepare the DP Launcher"
+msgstr "#### 5.2.2.1 准备 DP 启动器"
+
+msgid ""
+"Save the following script as `launch_online_dp.py` on all four nodes. It\n"
+"    divides the node's visible devices among local DP ranks and starts one\n"
+"    vLLM process per rank. The script is identical to the A3 example."
+msgstr ""
+"将以下脚本保存为所有四个节点上的 `launch_online_dp.py`。它\n"
+"    将节点可见的设备分配给本地 DP rank，并为每个 rank 启动一个\n"
+"    vLLM 进程。该脚本与 A3 示例相同。"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--dp-rank-start` | First DP rank assigned to this node. Prefill "
+"servers use `0` and `2`; Decode servers use `0` and `4`. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `--dp-rank-start` | 分配给此节点的第一个 DP rank。Prefill 服务器使用 `0` 和 `2`；Decode "
+"服务器使用 `0` 和 `4`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--dp-address` | IP address of the node that coordinates the "
+"corresponding DP group. Use the first Prefill IP on both Prefill nodes and "
+"the first Decode IP on both Decode nodes. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `--dp-address` | 协调对应 DP 组的节点 IP 地址。在两个 Prefill 节点上都使用第一个 Prefill "
+"IP，在两个 Decode 节点上都使用第一个 Decode IP。 |"
+
+msgid "#### 5.2.2.2 Start the Prefill Nodes"
+msgstr "#### 5.2.2.2 启动 Prefill 节点"
+
+msgid ""
+"On each Prefill node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`.\n"
+"    Set `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and `MODEL_PATH` to the local server's service\n"
+"    IP, network interface, and checkpoint path."
+msgstr ""
+"在每个 Prefill 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。\n"
+"    将 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 和 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为本地服务器的服务\n"
+"    IP、网络接口和 checkpoint 路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start two DP4/TP4 Prefill engines on each Prefill node. On the first\n"
+"    Prefill node (DP ranks 0-1), `--dp-address` uses that node's IP:"
+msgstr ""
+"在每个 Prefill 节点上启动两个 DP4/TP4 Prefill 引擎。在第一个\n"
+"    Prefill 节点（DP rank 0-1）上，`--dp-address` 使用该节点的 IP："
+
+msgid ""
+"On the second Prefill node (DP ranks 2-3), `--dp-address` still points to\n"
+"    the first Prefill node:"
+msgstr ""
+"在第二个 Prefill 节点（DP rank 2-3）上，`--dp-address` 仍指向\n"
+"    第一个 Prefill 节点："
+
+msgid "#### 5.2.2.3 Start the Decode Nodes"
+msgstr "#### 5.2.2.3 启动 Decode 节点"
+
+msgid ""
+"On each Decode node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`.\n"
+"    Set `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and `MODEL_PATH` to the local server's service\n"
+"    IP, network interface, and the same checkpoint path used on the Prefill\n"
+"    nodes."
+msgstr ""
+"在每个 Decode 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。\n"
+"    将 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 和 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为本地服务器的服务\n"
+"    IP、网络接口，以及与 Prefill 节点相同的 checkpoint 路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start four DP8/TP2 Decode engines on each Decode node. On the first Decode\n"
+"    node (DP ranks 0-3), `--dp-address` uses that node's IP:"
+msgstr ""
+"在每个 Decode 节点上启动四个 DP8/TP2 Decode 引擎。在第一个 Decode\n"
+"    节点（DP rank 0-3）上，`--dp-address` 使用该节点的 IP："
+
+msgid ""
+"On the second Decode node (DP ranks 4-7), `--dp-address` still points to\n"
+"    the first Decode node:"
+msgstr ""
+"在第二个 Decode 节点（DP rank 4-7）上，`--dp-address` 仍指向\n"
+"    第一个 Decode 节点："
+
+msgid "#### 5.2.2.4 Deploy the PD Proxy"
+msgstr "#### 5.2.2.4 部署 PD Proxy"
+
+msgid ""
+"After all twelve engines are ready (four Prefill and eight Decode), deploy\n"
+"    the proxy as described in\n"
+"    [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (DeepSeek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md).\n"
+"    Configure the proxy with Prefill endpoints `<PREFILL_NODE_1_IP>:7100` and\n"
+"    `<PREFILL_NODE_1_IP>:7101`, `<PREFILL_NODE_2_IP>:7100` and\n"
+"    `<PREFILL_NODE_2_IP>:7101`, and Decode endpoints\n"
+"    `<DECODE_NODE_1_IP>:7100` through `<DECODE_NODE_1_IP>:7103`,\n"
+"    `<DECODE_NODE_2_IP>:7100` through `<DECODE_NODE_2_IP>:7103`. For example,\n"
+"    run the load-balancing proxy on the first Prefill node:"
+msgstr ""
+"在所有十二个引擎就绪后（四个 Prefill 和八个 Decode），按照\n"
+"    [Prefill-Decode 分离（DeepSeek）](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)\n"
+"    中的说明部署 proxy。\n"
+"    为 proxy 配置 Prefill 端点 `<PREFILL_NODE_1_IP>:7100` 和\n"
+"    `<PREFILL_NODE_1_IP>:7101`、`<PREFILL_NODE_2_IP>:7100` 和\n"
+"    `<PREFILL_NODE_2_IP>:7101`，以及 Decode 端点\n"
+"    `<DECODE_NODE_1_IP>:7100` 至 `<DECODE_NODE_1_IP>:7103`、\n"
+"    `<DECODE_NODE_2_IP>:7100` 至 `<DECODE_NODE_2_IP>:7103`。例如，\n"
+"    在第一个 Prefill 节点上运行负载均衡 proxy："
+
+msgid "#### 5.2.2.5 Key Parameter Descriptions"
+msgstr "#### 5.2.2.5 关键参数说明"
+
+msgid ""
+"- The A2 layout is 1P1D: the Prefill role spans two servers (DP4/TP4\n"
+"      ranks each) and the Decode role spans two servers (DP8/TP2 ranks\n"
+"      each). On every A2 server the local DP ranks multiplied by TP must\n"
+"      consume all 8 devices: 2 × 4 on each Prefill server and 4 × 2 on each\n"
+"      Decode server.\n"
+"    - `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=360000` gives every Prefill and Decode\n"
+"      engine up to 100 hours to finish startup. Weights are loaded from shared\n"
+"      storage, which is slower on A2; this validated value is intentionally\n"
+"      larger than the A3 value.\n"
+"    - Both roles use `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'`.\n"
+"      The Engram table is kept in host memory and shared by the local DP\n"
+"      ranks of each server. With TP4 and TP2 the model's 24 Engram heads are\n"
+"      divided evenly (6 and 12 heads per rank), but the host-memory table must\n"
+"      still be shared across the node's local DP ranks, which requires the\n"
+"      container to run with `--ipc=host` or a `/dev/shm` of at least 320g.\n"
+"    - Prefix caching is enabled only on Prefill. Decode disables it and\n"
+"      enables `recompute_scheduler_enable` so requests can be recomputed when\n"
+"      the Prefill-side KV cache is unavailable.\n"
+"    - Prefill and Decode use the same --additional-config options as A3.\n"
+"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` and the socket interface variables must select the same\n"
+"      high-speed service network used by the configured node IPs.\n"
+"      `HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1` enables RoCE transport for intra-node HCCL\n"
+"      on A2. `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` is `1024` on Prefill and `1800` on Decode;\n"
+"      retain these role-specific values unless another setting has been\n"
+"      validated. `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=\"AIV\"` is set on Prefill only.\n"
+"    Wait until every engine finishes loading weights and Decode finishes graph\n"
+"    capture. A successful startup includes output similar to:"
+msgstr ""
+"- A2 布局为 1P1D：Prefill 角色跨两台服务器（每台为 DP4/TP4\n"
+"      rank），Decode 角色跨两台服务器（每台为 DP8/TP2\n"
+"      rank）。在每台 A2 服务器上，本地 DP rank 乘以 TP 必须\n"
+"      占满全部 8 个设备：每台 Prefill 服务器为 2 × 4，每台\n"
+"      Decode 服务器为 4 × 2。\n"
+"    - `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=360000` 为每个 Prefill 和 Decode\n"
+"      引擎提供最多 100 小时来完成启动。权重从共享\n"
+"      存储加载，在 A2 上较慢；此经过验证的值有意\n"
+"      大于 A3 的值。\n"
+"    - 两个角色都使用 `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'`。\n"
+"      Engram 表保存在主机内存中，由每台服务器的本地 DP\n"
+"      rank 共享。在 TP4 和 TP2 下，模型的 24 个 Engram head 被\n"
+"      均匀划分（每个 rank 分别为 6 和 12 个 head），但主机内存表\n"
+"      仍必须在该节点的本地 DP rank 之间共享，这要求\n"
+"      容器以 `--ipc=host` 运行，或 `/dev/shm` 至少为 320g。\n"
+"    - 前缀缓存仅在 Prefill 上启用。Decode 禁用它并\n"
+"      启用 `recompute_scheduler_enable`，以便在\n"
+"      Prefill 侧 KV cache 不可用时重新计算请求。\n"
+"    - Prefill 和 Decode 使用与 A3 相同的 --additional-config 选项。\n"
+"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` 和 socket 接口变量必须选择与\n"
+"      所配置节点 IP 相同的高速服务网络。\n"
+"      `HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1` 在 A2 上为节点内 HCCL 启用 RoCE\n"
+"      传输。`HCCL_BUFFSIZE` 在 Prefill 上为 `1024`，在 Decode 上为 `1800`；\n"
+"      除非已验证其他设置，否则保留这些角色特定的值。\n"
+"      `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=\"AIV\"` 仅在 Prefill 上设置。\n"
+"    等待每个引擎完成权重加载且 Decode 完成图\n"
+"    捕获。成功启动包含类似以下的输出："
+
+msgid "### 5.3 1P1D Deployment with Memcache KV Cache Pool"
+msgstr "### 5.3 使用 Memcache KV Cache Pool 的 1P1D 部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"This configuration extends the A3 1P1D deployment in Section 5.2 with a\n"
+"Memcache KV Cache Pool. `MooncakeHybridConnector` continues to transfer KV\n"
+"cache from Prefill to Decode, while `AscendStoreConnector` stores reusable KV\n"
+"cache in Memcache. Both connectors are configured as children of\n"
+"`MultiConnector`."
+msgstr ""
+"此配置在 5.2 节的 A3 1P1D 部署基础上增加了\n"
+"Memcache KV Cache Pool。`MooncakeHybridConnector` 继续将 KV\n"
+"cache 从 Prefill 传输到 Decode，而 `AscendStoreConnector` 将可复用的 KV\n"
+"cache 存储到 Memcache 中。两个 connector 都配置为\n"
+"`MultiConnector` 的子项。"
+
+msgid ""
+"DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash does not support layerwise KV Cache Pool access because its\n"
+"CED hybrid-attention model structure is incompatible with layer-by-layer KV\n"
+"save and load. Keep `use_layerwise` set to `false` on both Prefill and Decode."
+msgstr ""
+"DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 不支持分层 KV Cache Pool 访问，因为其\n"
+"CED 混合注意力模型结构与逐层 KV\n"
+"保存和加载不兼容。在 Prefill 和 Decode 上都将 `use_layerwise` 保持为 `false`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Before starting vLLM, follow the\n"
+"[Memcache backend guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)\n"
+"to install `memfabric-hybrid` and `memcache-hybrid`, configure\n"
+"`meta.conf`, `mmc-local.conf`, and `mmc-local-standalone.conf`, and start the\n"
+"Memcache MetaService. The\n"
+"Prefill and Decode nodes must use the same MetaService endpoint. Keep the\n"
+"`/etc/hccn.conf` container mount from Section 4.1."
+msgstr ""
+"在启动 vLLM 之前，请遵循\n"
+"[Memcache 后端指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)\n"
+"安装 `memfabric-hybrid` 和 `memcache-hybrid`，配置\n"
+"`meta.conf`、`mmc-local.conf` 和 `mmc-local-standalone.conf`，并启动\n"
+"Memcache MetaService。\n"
+"Prefill 和 Decode 节点必须使用相同的 MetaService 端点。保留\n"
+"4.1 节中的 `/etc/hccn.conf` 容器挂载。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This example uses separated Memcache deployment so that the pool reserves host\n"
+"memory before vLLM loads the model. Prepare one MetaService configuration and\n"
+"two LocalService configurations as described below."
+msgstr ""
+"此示例使用分离式 Memcache 部署，以便 pool 在 vLLM 加载模型之前预留主机\n"
+"内存。按下文所述准备一份 MetaService 配置和\n"
+"两份 LocalService 配置。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.3.1 Prepare the Memcache Services"
+msgstr "#### 5.3.1 准备 Memcache 服务"
+
+msgid "Create `meta.conf` on the node that runs MetaService:"
+msgstr "在运行 MetaService 的节点上创建 `meta.conf`："
+
+msgid ""
+"Create `mmc-local.conf` on both Prefill and Decode nodes for the LocalService\n"
+"embedded in vLLM:"
+msgstr ""
+"在 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上为嵌入 vLLM 的 LocalService\n"
+"创建 `mmc-local.conf`："
+
+msgid ""
+"Create `mmc-local-standalone.conf` on both nodes for the standalone Memcache\n"
+"process. It uses the same endpoints, world size, and protocol, but contributes\n"
+"the host DRAM used by the pool:"
+msgstr ""
+"在两个节点上为独立的 Memcache 进程创建 `mmc-local-standalone.conf`。\n"
+"它使用相同的端点、world size 和协议，但贡献\n"
+"pool 所使用的主机 DRAM："
+
+msgid ""
+"`world_size` is the maximum number of LocalServices that can join the pool, not\n"
+"the DP size. Changing it after LocalServices connect requires restarting\n"
+"MetaService. `device_sdma` is recommended for A3 HCCS and requires LingQu\n"
+"Computing Network 1.5 or later. The `200GB` standalone DRAM value is an example;\n"
+"set it according to the host memory available after reserving capacity for the\n"
+"operating system and vLLM. `max.dram.size` must be at least the largest\n"
+"`dram.size` contributed by any LocalService."
+msgstr ""
+"`world_size` 是能够加入池的 LocalService 最大数量，而不是 DP 大小。在 LocalService 连接后修改该值需要重启 "
+"MetaService。对于 A3 HCCS，推荐使用 `device_sdma`，并且需要 LingQu Computing Network 1.5 "
+"或更高版本。`200GB` 的独立 DRAM 值只是一个示例；请根据为操作系统和 vLLM "
+"预留容量后主机可用的内存进行设置。`max.dram.size` 必须至少等于任一 LocalService 贡献的最大 `dram.size`。"
+
+msgid "Start MetaService with `meta.conf`:"
+msgstr "使用 `meta.conf` 启动 MetaService："
+
+msgid ""
+"Save the following script as `memcache_standalone.py` on both Prefill and\n"
+"Decode nodes:"
+msgstr "在 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `memcache_standalone.py`："
+
+msgid ""
+"After MetaService is ready, start the standalone Memcache process on both\n"
+"Prefill and Decode nodes and wait for successful initialization:"
+msgstr "MetaService 就绪后，在 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上启动独立的 Memcache 进程，并等待初始化成功："
+
+msgid ""
+"For additional parameters and capacity constraints, refer to\n"
+"[Memcache and vLLM separated deployment](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#Memcache-and-vLLM-Separated-Deployment)."
+msgstr ""
+"有关其他参数和容量限制，请参阅\n"
+"[Memcache 与 vLLM 分离部署](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#Memcache-and-vLLM-Separated-Deployment)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Reuse `launch_online_dp.py` from Section 5.2.1.1. Set `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` to\n"
+"the `Location` reported by `pip show memcache_hybrid`, and set\n"
+"`MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` to the absolute directory containing the configuration\n"
+"files above on both nodes."
+msgstr ""
+"复用 5.2.1.1 节中的 `launch_online_dp.py`。将 `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` 设置为 `pip show"
+" memcache_hybrid` 报告的 `Location`，并在两个节点上将 `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` "
+"设置为包含上述配置文件的绝对目录。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.3.2 Start the Prefill Node with Pooling"
+msgstr "#### 5.3.2 启动带池化的 Prefill 节点"
+
+msgid ""
+"On the Prefill node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
+"`LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, `MODEL_PATH`, `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH`, and\n"
+"`MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` for the local environment."
+msgstr ""
+"在 Prefill 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。根据本地环境设置\n"
+"`LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`、`MODEL_PATH`、`MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` 和\n"
+"`MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the four DP4/TP4 Prefill engines with the launcher command from "
+"Section 5.2.1.2 after all Decode engines are ready."
+msgstr "在所有 Decode 引擎就绪后，使用 5.2.1.2 节中的启动器命令启动四个 DP4/TP4 Prefill 引擎。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.3.3 Start the Decode Node with Pooling"
+msgstr "#### 5.3.3 启动带池化的 Decode 节点"
+
+msgid ""
+"On the Decode node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
+"`LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, `MODEL_PATH`, `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH`, and\n"
+"`MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` for the local environment."
+msgstr ""
+"在 Decode 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。根据本地环境设置\n"
+"`LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`、`MODEL_PATH`、`MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` 和\n"
+"`MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the eight DP8/TP2 Decode engines with the launcher command from Section\n"
+"5.2.3."
+msgstr "使用 5.2.3 节中的启动器命令启动八个 DP8/TP2 Decode 引擎。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.3.4 Startup and Verification"
+msgstr "#### 5.3.4 启动与验证"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the components in this order: Memcache MetaService, standalone Memcache\n"
+"on both Prefill and Decode nodes, Decode engines, Prefill engines, and then the\n"
+"PD proxy."
+msgstr ""
+"按以下顺序启动各组件：Memcache MetaService、Prefill 和 Decode 节点上的独立 Memcache、Decode "
+"引擎、Prefill 引擎，最后是 PD 代理。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Wait until both standalone Memcache processes report successful initialization\n"
+"before starting the Decode engines. Then wait until every Decode engine reports\n"
+"`Application startup complete` before starting Prefill. After every Prefill engine is ready, start the proxy with the\n"
+"same endpoint mapping described in Section 5.2.1.4."
+msgstr ""
+"在启动 Decode 引擎之前，等待两个独立 Memcache 进程均报告初始化成功。然后等待每个 Decode 引擎报告\n"
+"`Application startup complete` 后再启动 Prefill。在所有 Prefill 引擎就绪后，使用 5.2.1.4 节中描述的相同端点映射启动代理。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Send the same request twice with a reusable prefix. Confirm that Prefill logs\n"
+"show Memcache lookup, get, put, and hit activity, and that Decode logs still\n"
+"show normal Prefill-to-Decode KV transfer."
+msgstr ""
+"使用可复用的前缀发送两次相同的请求。确认 Prefill 日志显示 Memcache 的查找、获取、写入和命中活动，并且 Decode 日志仍显示正常的"
+" Prefill 到 Decode KV 传输。"
+
+msgid "Key pooling parameters:"
+msgstr "关键池化参数："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `MultiConnector` combines live P-to-D transfer through\n"
+"  `MooncakeHybridConnector` with persistent prefix reuse through\n"
+"  `AscendStoreConnector`.\n"
+"- `backend: \"memcache\"` selects Memcache as the KV Cache Pool backend.\n"
+"- `use_layerwise: false` is required for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash. Do not enable\n"
+"  layerwise pooling for this model because its CED hybrid-attention structure\n"
+"  is not supported by the layerwise path."
+msgstr ""
+"- `MultiConnector` 将通过 `MooncakeHybridConnector` 进行的实时 P-to-D 传输与通过 `AscendStoreConnector` 进行的持久化前缀复用相结合。\n"
+"- `backend: \"memcache\"` 选择 Memcache 作为 KV Cache Pool 后端。\n"
+"- DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 需要设置 `use_layerwise: false`。请勿为此模型启用分层池化，因为其 CED 混合注意力结构不受分层路径支持。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For Memcache configuration, capacity tuning, and troubleshooting, refer to the\n"
+"[KV Cache Pool guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)."
+msgstr ""
+"有关 Memcache 配置、容量调优和故障排除，请参阅\n"
+"[KV Cache Pool 指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)。"
+
+msgid "### 5.4 1P1D Deployment with Mooncake KV Cache Pool"
+msgstr "### 5.4 使用 Mooncake KV Cache Pool 的 1P1D 部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"This configuration extends the A2 1P1D deployment in Section 5.2 with a\n"
+"Mooncake KV Cache Pool. `MooncakeHybridConnector` continues to transfer KV\n"
+"cache from Prefill to Decode, while `AscendStoreConnector` stores reusable KV\n"
+"cache in Mooncake. Both connectors are configured as children of\n"
+"`MultiConnector`."
+msgstr ""
+"此配置在 5.2 节的 A2 1P1D 部署基础上增加了 Mooncake KV Cache "
+"Pool。`MooncakeHybridConnector` 继续将 KV 缓存从 Prefill 传输到 Decode，而 "
+"`AscendStoreConnector` 将可复用的 KV 缓存存储在 Mooncake 中。两个连接器均配置为 `MultiConnector` "
+"的子连接器。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Before starting vLLM, configure `mooncake.json`, and start the\n"
+"mooncake_master Service. The Prefill and Decode nodes must export `MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH` ."
+msgstr ""
+"在启动 vLLM 之前，配置 `mooncake.json` 并启动 mooncake_master 服务。Prefill 和 Decode "
+"节点必须导出 `MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH`。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.4.1 Prepare the Mooncake Services"
+msgstr "#### 5.4.1 准备 Mooncake 服务"
+
+msgid "Configure `mooncake.json`:"
+msgstr "配置 `mooncake.json`："
+
+msgid "Start mooncake_master:"
+msgstr "启动 mooncake_master："
+
+msgid ""
+"After `mooncake.json` is ready, start the mooncake_master process on one "
+"node and wait for successful initialization:"
+msgstr "`mooncake.json` 就绪后，在一个节点上启动 mooncake_master 进程，并等待初始化成功："
+
+msgid ""
+"eviction_high_watermark_ratio determines the watermark where Mooncake Store will perform eviction.\n"
+"eviction_ratio determines the portion of stored objects that would be evicted.\n"
+"default_kv_lease_ttl controls the default lease TTL for KV objects (milliseconds).\n"
+"configure it via --default_kv_lease_ttl and keep it larger than ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT and ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT."
+msgstr ""
+"eviction_high_watermark_ratio 决定 Mooncake Store 执行驱逐的水位线。\n"
+"eviction_ratio 决定将被驱逐的已存储对象的比例。\n"
+"default_kv_lease_ttl 控制 KV 对象的默认租约 TTL（毫秒）。\n"
+"通过 --default_kv_lease_ttl 进行配置，并保持其大于 ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT 和 ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.4.2 Start the Prefill Node with Pooling"
+msgstr "#### 5.4.2 启动带池化的 Prefill 节点"
+
+msgid ""
+"On the Prefill node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
+"`LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, `MODEL_PATH`, and\n"
+"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR` for the local environment."
+msgstr ""
+"在 Prefill 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。根据本地环境设置\n"
+"`LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`、`MODEL_PATH` 和\n"
+"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the four DP4/TP4 Prefill engines with the launcher command from "
+"Section 5.2.2.2 after all Decode engines are ready."
+msgstr "在所有 Decode 引擎就绪后，使用 5.2.2.2 节中的启动器命令启动四个 DP4/TP4 Prefill 引擎。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.4.3 Start the Decode Node with Pooling"
+msgstr "#### 5.4.3 启动带池化的 Decode 节点"
+
+msgid ""
+"On the Decode node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
+"`LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, `MODEL_PATH`, and\n"
+"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR` for the local environment."
+msgstr ""
+"在 Decode 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。根据本地环境设置\n"
+"`LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`、`MODEL_PATH` 和\n"
+"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the eight DP8/TP2 Decode engines with the launcher command from "
+"Section 5.2.2.3."
+msgstr "使用 5.2.2.3 节中的启动器命令启动八个 DP8/TP2 Decode 引擎。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.4.4 Startup and Verification"
+msgstr "#### 5.4.4 启动与验证"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the components in this order: Mooncake Master Service, Decode engines, Prefill engines, and then the PD proxy. The Mooncake Store clients are embedded in the vLLM processes; no standalone Store process is required for this configuration.\n"
+"Wait until the Mooncake master process reports successful initialization before starting the Decode engines and the Prefill engines. After every Prefill engine and every Decode engine is ready, start the proxy with the same endpoint mapping described in Section 5.2.2.4."
+msgstr ""
+"按以下顺序启动各组件：Mooncake Master Service、Decode 引擎、Prefill 引擎，最后是 PD 代理。Mooncake Store 客户端内嵌在 vLLM 进程中；此配置无需独立的 Store 进程。\n"
+"在启动 Decode 引擎和 Prefill 引擎之前，请等待 Mooncake master 进程报告初始化成功。待所有 Prefill 引擎和所有 Decode 引擎就绪后，使用第 5.2.2.4 节中描述的相同端点映射启动代理。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Send the same request twice with a reusable prefix. Confirm that Prefill "
+"logs show Mooncake lookup, get, put, and hit activity, and that Decode logs "
+"still show normal Prefill-to-Decode KV transfer."
+msgstr ""
+"使用可复用的前缀发送同一请求两次。确认 Prefill 日志显示 Mooncake 的 lookup、get、put 和 hit 活动，并且 "
+"Decode 日志仍显示正常的 Prefill 到 Decode 的 KV 传输。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `MultiConnector` combines live P-to-D transfer through `MooncakeHybridConnector` with persistent prefix reuse through `AscendStoreConnector`.\n"
+"- `backend: \"mooncake\"` selects Mooncake as the KV Cache Pool backend.\n"
+"- `use_layerwise: false` is required for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash. Do not enable layerwise pooling for this model because its CED hybrid-attention structure is not supported by the layerwise path."
+msgstr ""
+"- `MultiConnector` 通过 `MooncakeHybridConnector` 实现实时的 P 到 D 传输，并通过 `AscendStoreConnector` 实现持久化前缀复用。\n"
+"- `backend: \"mooncake\"` 选择 Mooncake 作为 KV Cache Pool 后端。\n"
+"- DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 需要设置 `use_layerwise: false`。请勿为此模型启用 layerwise 池化，因为其 CED 混合注意力结构不受 layerwise 路径支持。"
+
+msgid "### 5.5 Multi-Node Colocated Deployment"
+msgstr "### 5.5 多节点共置部署"
+
+msgid "### 5.6 Service Verification"
+msgstr "### 5.6 服务验证"
+
+msgid ""
+"Refer to [Using AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)\n"
+"to evaluate the deployed service. Accuracy results will be documented in the\n"
+"[release notes](../../user_guide/release_notes.md). When reporting results, record the\n"
+"checkpoint, prompt encoder, reasoning effort, sampling parameters, dataset\n"
+"version, and whether DSpark is enabled."
+msgstr ""
+"请参阅[使用 AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)\n"
+"以评估已部署的服务。精度结果将记录在\n"
+"[发布说明](../../user_guide/release_notes.md)中。报告结果时，请记录\n"
+"checkpoint、prompt encoder、推理强度、采样参数、数据集\n"
+"版本以及是否启用了 DSpark。"
