-
-msgid ""
-"Prefill-Decode disaggregation with the `GLM-5.2-w8a8c8` weights can be "
-"deployed on 4 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16)."
-msgstr "使用`GLM-5.2-w8a8c8`权重的Prefill-Decode分离可以部署在4个Atlas 800 A3（64GB × 16）上。"
-
-msgid "**PP2 prefill node-specific configurations (p0/p1):**"
-msgstr "**PP2 prefill节点特定配置（p0/p1）：**"
-
-msgid "**Decode node-specific configurations (d0/d1):**"
-msgstr "**Decode节点特定配置（d0/d1）：**"
-
-msgid ""
-"- `enable_mlapo`: MLAPO fusion on decode nodes for memory-bandwidth-bound token generation.\n"
-"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 192`: Small batch token limit on decode nodes — decode processes one target token plus the 5 speculated MTP tokens per sequence per step (`(5 + 1) × 32`).\n"
-"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 5, ...}'`: Higher MTP speculation count on decode nodes to maximize decode throughput.\n"
-"- `recompute_scheduler_enable=true`: Enables the recomputation scheduler. When the decode node KV cache is insufficient, requests are sent back to the prefill node to recompute the KV cache.\n"
-"- `--async-scheduling`: Async scheduling on the decode side."
-msgstr ""
-"- `enable_mlapo`：在decode节点上进行MLAPO融合，用于内存带宽受限的token生成。\n"
-"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 192`：decode节点上的小批量token限制——decode每步每序列处理一个目标token加上5个推测的MTP token（`(5 + 1) × 32`）。\n"
-"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 5, ...}'`：decode节点上更高的MTP推测数量，以最大化decode吞吐量。\n"
-"- `recompute_scheduler_enable=true`：启用重计算调度器。当decode节点KV缓存不足时，请求会被发送回prefill节点以重计算KV缓存。\n"
-"- `--async-scheduling`：decode端的异步调度。"
-
-msgid ""
-"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`: Uses Mooncake as the KV cache transfer connector between prefill and decode nodes.\n"
-"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`: `kv_producer` on prefill nodes, `kv_consumer` on decode nodes.\n"
-"- `\"kv_port\"`: Port for Mooncake KV transfer communication. Use different port ranges for prefill (`30000`) and decode (`30200`) node groups.\n"
-"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`: Enables Ascend direct transfer for KV cache, reducing latency.\n"
-"- `\"engine_id\"`: Fixed engine id of the Mooncake connector per role group: `0` for the prefill engine (shared by the two PP ranks) and `2` for the decode engines.\n"
-"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` sections: Specify the parallelism of the prefill and decode node groups respectively. These must match the actual deployment topology (`prefill: dp_size 1, pp_size 2, tp_size 16, pp_layer_partition \"41,37\"`, `decode: dp_size 16, tp_size 2`)."
-msgstr ""
-"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`：使用Mooncake作为prefill和decode节点之间的KV缓存传输连接器。\n"
-"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`：prefill节点上为`kv_producer`，decode节点上为`kv_consumer`。\n"
-"- `\"kv_port\"`：Mooncake KV传输通信端口。为prefill（`30000`）和decode（`30200`）节点组使用不同的端口范围。\n"
-"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`：为KV缓存启用Ascend直接传输，降低延迟。\n"
-"- `\"engine_id\"`：每个角色组的Mooncake连接器的固定引擎ID：prefill引擎为`0`（由两个PP rank共享），decode引擎为`2`。\n"
-"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"`部分：分别指定prefill和decode节点组的并行度。这些必须与实际部署拓扑匹配（`prefill: dp_size 1, pp_size 2, tp_size 16, pp_layer_partition \"41,37\"`，`decode: dp_size 16, tp_size 2`）。"
-
