-msgid ""
-"**1M-specific environment variables (both prefiller and decoder nodes):**"
-msgstr "**1M场景特有的环境变量（prefiller和decoder节点均需设置）：**"
-
-msgid ""
-"- `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30000` / "
-"`MF_GROUP_JOIN_MAX_TIMEOUT=1200`: Timeout settings for the slow multi-node "
-"startup and model execution of the 1M context scenario. Increase them if the"
-" engine fails to become ready in time."
-msgstr ""
-"- `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30000` / "
-"`MF_GROUP_JOIN_MAX_TIMEOUT=1200`：针对1M上下文场景中较慢的多节点启动和模型执行的超时设置。如果引擎未能及时就绪，请增大这些值。"
-
-msgid ""
-"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1, ...}'`: Minimal MTP speculation during prefill.\n"
-"- `mega_moe_max_tokens=8192`: Per-rank token capacity after dispatch in the fused MC2/MegaMoe path.\n"
-"- `--kv-transfer-config`: Mooncake connector as `kv_producer` with `prefill: dp2 tp16` / `decode: dp4 tp8`."
-msgstr ""
-"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1, ...}'`：prefill期间的最小MTP投机。\n"
-"- `mega_moe_max_tokens=8192`：在融合的MC2/MegaMoe路径中dispatch后每个rank的token容量。\n"
-"- `--kv-transfer-config`：Mooncake连接器作为`kv_producer`，配置为`prefill: dp2 tp16` / `decode: dp4 tp8`。"
-
-msgid ""
-"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 192`: Small batch token limit on decode nodes — decode nodes store the large 1M KV cache received from prefill nodes.\n"
-"- `enable_mlapo`: MLAPO fusion on decode nodes for memory-bandwidth-bound token generation.\n"
-"- `--kv-transfer-config`: Mooncake connector as `kv_consumer` (`kv_port: 30200`)."
-msgstr ""
-"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 192`：decode节点上的小批量token限制——decode节点存储从prefill节点接收的大型1M KV缓存。\n"
-"- `enable_mlapo`：在decode节点上启用MLAPO融合，用于内存带宽受限的token生成。\n"
-"- `--kv-transfer-config`：Mooncake连接器作为`kv_consumer`（`kv_port: 30200`）。"
