+
+msgid ""
+"An explicit `--data-parallel-rank` enables external DP load balancing, which"
+" vLLM requires to have `DP_SIZE > 1`. The templates below build "
+"`DP_RANK_ARGS` from the actual `DP_SIZE`: omit the rank argument for DP1, "
+"and pass the launcher-assigned rank for DP greater than 1. Keep `DP_RANK` "
+"available for per-rank connector ports, including in DP1."
+msgstr ""
+"显式指定 `--data-parallel-rank` 可启用外部 DP 负载均衡，vLLM 要求此时 `DP_SIZE > 1`。下面的模板根据实际的"
+" `DP_SIZE` 构建 `DP_RANK_ARGS`：DP1 时省略 rank 参数，DP 大于 1 时传入启动器分配的 rank。请保留 "
+"`DP_RANK` 供各 rank 的连接器端口使用，DP1 时也是如此。"
+
+msgid "**1. Prefill node**"
+msgstr "**1. Prefill 节点**"
+
+msgid "**2. Decode node**"
+msgstr "**2. Decode 节点**"
+
+msgid "**2. First Decode node (`DECODE0_IP`, global ranks 0–3)**"
+msgstr "**2. 第一个 Decode 节点（`DECODE0_IP`，全局 rank 0–3）**"
+
+msgid "**3. Second Decode node (`DECODE1_IP`, global ranks 4–7)**"
+msgstr "**3. 第二个 Decode 节点（`DECODE1_IP`，全局 rank 4–7）**"
+
+msgid ""
+"The first Decode node serves API ports `31060`/`31061` and the second "
+"`31062`/`31063`. Wait until all four DP ranks print `Application startup "
+"complete`. The template base `kv_port` (`26900`) can remain the same on both"
+" Decode nodes. Keep the global DP ranks distinct (0–1 and 2–3); Mooncake "
+"derives handshake ports using the global DP-rank offset. Start the proxy "
+"only after all six engines are up (the example proxy waits only a few "
+"seconds per backend), registering two Prefill ranks and four DP ranks:"
+msgstr ""
+"第一个 Decode 节点提供 API 端口 `31060`/`31061`，第二个提供 `31062`/`31063`。请等待全部四个 DP rank"
+" 打印 `Application startup complete`。模板基础 `kv_port`（`26900`）可以在两个 Decode "
+"节点上保持一致。请确保全局 DP rank 互不相同（0–1 和 2–3）；Mooncake 使用全局 DP rank "
+"偏移量推导握手端口。请在所有六个引擎启动完成后再启动代理（示例代理对每个后端只等待几秒），并注册两个 Prefill rank 和四个 DP rank："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--language-model-only` (optional): For text-only tests, add this flag as needed based on the available KV cache capacity to avoid reserving memory for multimodal processing. This flag can be used together with FLASHCOMM1 for text-only serving.\n"
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size` (A3 Prefill: `4`): Splits the 60 MiniMax-M3 layers across four pipeline stages. A3 sets `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=16,15,15,14` and also writes `pp_layer_partition` into the Mooncake extra config. With `TP=4`, use `DP=1` to fit all four stages on one 16-NPU node. The 950DT products launch uses `--pp-size 1` on both Prefill and Decode (no pipeline parallel), so no layer partition is needed.\n"
+"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` (A3 Prefill: `8192`): For better prefill performance, use `8192` when the input length is at least 8192 tokens; for shorter inputs, set it to the input token length. This recommendation also applies to A3 Prefill with KV Cache Pool in Section 5.3.2.\n"
+"- `--enforce-eager`: Prefill nodes retain eager execution without graph capture.\n"
+"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`: The ordinary-context Decode examples and the single-node examples in Section 5.4.1 use full graph capture for decode-only batches. Section 5.4.2 uses eager execution for its 1M-context PD layout.\n"
+"- `--speculative-config '{\"method\":\"eagle3\", ...}'`: Enables the `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA` draft model. Do not replace this with GLM MTP options."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--language-model-only`（可选）：对于纯文本测试，可根据可用的 KV cache 容量按需添加此标志，以避免为多模态处理预留内存。该标志可与 FLASHCOMM1 一起用于纯文本服务。\n"
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size`（A3 Prefill：`4`）：将 60 层 MiniMax-M3 拆分到四个流水线阶段。A3 设置 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=16,15,15,14`，并将 `pp_layer_partition` 写入 Mooncake 额外配置。在 `TP=4` 时，使用 `DP=1` 可将全部四个阶段放在一个 16-NPU 节点上。Ascend 950DT系列产品启动时在 Prefill 和 Decode 上均使用 `--pp-size 1`（无流水线并行），因此无需层划分。\n"
+"- `--max-num-batched-tokens`（A3 Prefill：`8192`）：为获得更好的 prefill 性能，当输入长度至少为 8192 个 token 时使用 `8192`；对于更短的输入，将其设置为输入 token 长度。此建议同样适用于 5.3.2 节中带 KV Cache Pool 的 A3 Prefill。\n"
+"- `--enforce-eager`：Prefill 节点保留 eager 执行，不进行图捕获。\n"
+"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`：普通上下文的 Decode 示例以及 5.4.1 节中的单节点示例对仅 decode 批次使用全图捕获。5.4.2 节对其 1M 上下文的 PD 布局使用 eager 执行。\n"
+"- `--speculative-config '{\"method\":\"eagle3\", ...}'`：启用 `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA` 草稿模型。请勿将其替换为 GLM MTP 选项。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `lookup_rpc_port` | Not used | **Must be unique per DP rank** "
+"(`37000/37100 + DP_RANK`) to avoid IPC endpoint collisions |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `lookup_rpc_port` | 未使用 | **每个 DP rank 必须唯一**（`37000/37100 + DP_RANK`），以避免"
+" IPC 端点冲突 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use a local SSD directory on each Prefill and Decode host to store KV cache "
+"data offloaded from the memory pool. `/nvme/mooncake_offload` is an example "
+"directory inside the container, not a required SSD mount point or a "
+"directory that already exists on every host."
+msgstr ""
+"在每个 Prefill 和 Decode 主机上使用本地 SSD 目录来存储从内存池卸载的 KV cache "
+"数据。`/nvme/mooncake_offload` 是容器内的示例目录，并非必需的 SSD 挂载点，也不是每台主机上都已存在的目录。"
+
+msgid "On each host, first identify the local SSD and its mount point:"
+msgstr "在每台主机上，首先识别本地 SSD 及其挂载点："
+
+msgid ""
+"Use `MODEL` to identify the SSD and `MOUNTPOINTS` to find its mounted "
+"filesystem. `ROTA=0` indicates a non-rotational device; confirm the storage "
+"type with the machine's disk information, especially for RAID or virtual "
+"disks. Choose an existing local SSD filesystem with enough free space. A "
+"shared network filesystem is not the local SSD tier."
+msgstr ""
+"使用 `MODEL` 识别 SSD，使用 `MOUNTPOINTS` 查找其挂载的文件系统。`ROTA=0` "
+"表示非旋转设备；请通过机器的磁盘信息确认存储类型，尤其是 RAID 或虚拟磁盘。选择一个已存在且具有足够可用空间的本地 SSD "
+"文件系统。共享网络文件系统不属于本地 SSD 层级。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For example, if the SSD is mounted at `/data/nvme`, create the offload "
+"directory there before starting the container. Replace `/data/nvme` below "
+"with the actual SSD mount point:"
+msgstr ""
+"例如，如果 SSD 挂载在 `/data/nvme`，请在启动容器前在该处创建卸载目录。将下面的 `/data/nvme` 替换为实际的 SSD "
+"挂载点："
+
+msgid ""
+"Confirm that `findmnt` reports the selected SSD filesystem and that `df` "
+"shows enough available space. Creating a directory named `/nvme` alone does "
+"not mount an SSD or ensure that data is stored on one."
+msgstr ""
+"确认 `findmnt` 报告的是所选 SSD 文件系统，并且 `df` 显示有足够的可用空间。仅创建一个名为 `/nvme` 的目录并不会挂载 "
+"SSD，也不能确保数据存储在其上。"
+
+msgid "Add this bind mount when creating each model container:"
+msgstr "在创建每个模型容器时添加此绑定挂载："
+
+msgid ""
+"The left side is the directory on that host's SSD; the right side is the "
+"directory visible inside the container. With this mapping, keep "
+"`\"ssd_offload_path\": \"/nvme/mooncake_offload\"` in `mooncake.json`. If "
+"the container path changes, update `ssd_offload_path` to match. Use an "
+"absolute path that exists and is writable by the vLLM process; do not use a "
+"symlink. Repeat this setup on P and every D host: identical path strings "
+"refer to separate local SSD storage on each host. The backend creates per-"
+"rank subdirectories beneath it. The installed Mooncake package must support "
+"the `enable_ssd_offload` and `ssd_offload_path` arguments in "
+"`MooncakeDistributedStore.setup()`; use the dependencies in the [KV Cache "
+"Pool Deployment "
+"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)."
+msgstr ""
+"左侧是该主机 SSD 上的目录；右侧是容器内可见的目录。使用此映射时，请在 `mooncake.json` 中保留 "
+"`\"ssd_offload_path\": \"/nvme/mooncake_offload\"`。如果容器路径发生变化，请更新 "
+"`ssd_offload_path` 以保持一致。请使用存在且 vLLM 进程可写的绝对路径；不要使用符号链接。在 P 和每个 D "
+"主机上重复此设置：相同的路径字符串在每台主机上指向各自独立的本地 SSD 存储。后端会在其下创建各 rank 的子目录。已安装的 Mooncake "
+"包必须支持 `MooncakeDistributedStore.setup()` 中的 `enable_ssd_offload` 和 "
+"`ssd_offload_path` 参数；请使用 [KV Cache Pool "
+"部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) 中的依赖项。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start from the Section 5.3.1 environment block (`HCCL_IF_IP`, `HCCL`/`GLOO` "
+"socket IFNAME, `HCCL_BUFFSIZE`, `PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF`, "
+"`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES`, and A3 Prefill "
+"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"16,15,15,14\"`). Then add the pooling-required "
+"variables below. Choose the hardware/communication exports from [Environment"
+" Variables "
+"Description](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) "
+"according to your machine and link type."
+msgstr ""
+"从 5.3.1 节的环境变量块开始（`HCCL_IF_IP`、`HCCL`/`GLOO` socket "
+"IFNAME、`HCCL_BUFFSIZE`、`PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF`、`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` "
+"以及 A3 Prefill 的 "
+"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"16,15,15,14\"`）。然后添加下面池化所需的变量。请根据你的机器和链路类型，从 "
+"[环境变量说明](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) "
+"中选择硬件/通信相关的导出项。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The SSD I/O buffer is allocated separately from `global_segment_size`. The "
+"`1GB` value above is an aligned starting point; size it for the KV "
+"read/write batches and include it in the per-rank memory budget."
+msgstr ""
+"SSD I/O 缓冲区与 `global_segment_size` 分开分配。上面的 `1GB` 值是一个对齐的起始值；请根据 KV "
+"读写批次确定其大小，并将其计入每个 rank 的内存预算。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For this three-tier (NPU, host memory, and SSD) example, the recommended "
+"starting SSD budget is **10 GiB per NPU worker rank** on every Prefill and "
+"Decode node. The two capacity limits describe the same SSD budget; they do "
+"not add up to 20 GiB:"
+msgstr ""
+"对于此三层（NPU、主机内存和 SSD）示例，建议在每个 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上为**每个 NPU worker rank 预留 10"
+" GiB** 的 SSD 起始预算。这两个容量限制描述的是同一份 SSD 预算；它们不会累加为 20 GiB："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_TOTAL_SIZE_LIMIT_BYTES` sets the per-worker SSD capacity reported to Mooncake Master. Its default is `2199023255552` bytes (2 TiB) per worker; this is advertised capacity, not an immediate disk allocation.\n"
+"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_BUCKET_MAX_TOTAL_SIZE` sets the local bucket size limit. Its default is `0`, meaning 90% of the physical disk capacity. Set it explicitly alongside the reported capacity."
+msgstr ""
+"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_TOTAL_SIZE_LIMIT_BYTES` 设置上报给 Mooncake Master 的每个 worker 的 SSD 容量。其默认值为每个 worker `2199023255552` 字节（2 TiB）；这是对外通告的容量，并非立即分配的磁盘空间。\n"
+"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_BUCKET_MAX_TOTAL_SIZE` 设置本地 bucket 大小限制。其默认值为 `0`，表示物理磁盘容量的 90%。请结合上报容量显式设置该项。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Adjust both values to the workload and usable SSD space, allowing for all "
+"workers sharing that disk and leaving room for other data. Count TP and PP "
+"worker ranks, not just DP ranks or physical cards: an A3 node with 16 "
+"logical NPU workers has a combined budget of 160 GiB at 10 GiB per worker. "
+"These limits control SSD usage; they do not change the host-memory pool or "
+"SSD I/O buffer size. For details, see [Mooncake SSD Offload Parameter "
+"Tuning](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#mooncake-"
+"ssd-offload-parameter-tuning)."
+msgstr ""
+"请根据工作负载和可用 SSD 空间调整这两个值，需考虑共享该磁盘的所有 worker，并为其他数据留出空间。请按 TP 和 PP 的 worker "
+"rank 数量计算，而不仅仅是 DP rank 或物理卡数量：一台拥有 16 个逻辑 NPU worker 的 A3 节点，按每个 worker 10 "
+"GiB 计算，合计预算为 160 GiB。这些限制控制 SSD 使用量；它们不会改变主机内存池或 SSD I/O 缓冲区大小。详情请参见 "
+"[Mooncake SSD Offload "
+"参数调优](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#mooncake-"
+"ssd-offload-parameter-tuning)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Reuse Section 5.3.1 `launch_online_dp.py`. Replace each role's "
+"`run_dp_template.sh` with the pooled version below. Keep the Section 5.3.1 "
+"`vllm serve` flag style; only `--kv-transfer-config` switches to "
+"`MultiConnector`. Derive `lookup_rpc_port` from `DP_RANK` so each rank uses "
+"a distinct IPC endpoint."
+msgstr ""
+"复用 5.3.1 节的 `launch_online_dp.py`。将每个角色的 `run_dp_template.sh` 替换为下方的池化版本。保持 "
+"5.3.1 节的 `vllm serve` 参数风格；仅将 `--kv-transfer-config` 切换为 `MultiConnector`。根据"
+" `DP_RANK` 推导 `lookup_rpc_port`，使每个 rank 使用不同的 IPC 端点。"
+
+msgid ""
+"MiniMax-M3 supports 1M-token contexts with single-node deployment on Atlas "
+"800I A3 (W8A8) and 950DT (MXFP8), and with the three-node A3 Prefill-Decode "
+"layout in Section 5.4.2. Here, 1M means 1,048,576 tokens. `--max-model-len` "
+"limits the total input and generated tokens, so reserve output space when "
+"preparing a request."
+msgstr ""
+"MiniMax-M3 支持 1M token 上下文，可在 Atlas 800I A3（W8A8）和 950DT（MXFP8）上单节点部署，也可采用 "
+"5.4.2 节中的三节点 A3 Prefill-Decode 布局。此处 1M 指 1,048,576 个 token。`--max-model-"
+"len` 限制输入与生成 token 的总量，因此在准备请求时需预留输出空间。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.4.1 Single-Node Deployment"
+msgstr "#### 5.4.1 单节点部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"The following single-node examples use the previously verified long-context "
+"deployment layouts with `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` as the graph mode."
+msgstr "以下单节点示例使用此前已验证的长上下文部署布局，并以 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 作为图模式。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.4.2 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation"
+msgstr "#### 5.4.2 Prefill-Decode 分离部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"This example uses three Atlas 800I A3 nodes (16 × 64GB NPUs per node) with "
+"W8A8 weights: one Prefill service and one Decode service distributed across "
+"two nodes. It uses `MooncakeConnectorV1` for direct P→D KV transfer. The "
+"1M-context PD configuration below is provided for A3."
+msgstr ""
+"本示例使用三台 Atlas 800I A3 节点（每节点 16 × 64GB NPU）和 W8A8 权重：一个 Prefill 服务和一个 Decode"
+" 服务分布在两台节点上。它使用 `MooncakeConnectorV1` 进行直接的 P→D KV 传输。下方的 1M 上下文 PD 配置针对 A3 "
+"提供。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Role | Global DP / TP / PP | Local DP ranks | API ports | `max-num-"
+"batched-tokens` | `long-prefill-token-threshold` |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 角色 | 全局 DP / TP / PP | 本地 DP rank | API 端口 | `max-num-batched-tokens` | "
+"`long-prefill-token-threshold` |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Both roles use Model Runner V2, `--max-model-len 1049600`, `--max-num-seqs "
+"1`, `--kv-cache-dtype auto`, FLASHCOMM1, chunked prefill, and text-only "
+"serving. Prefix caching, asynchronous scheduling, shared-expert DP, static "
+"kernels, and EAGLE3 are disabled. Prefill splits the 60 layers as `30,30` "
+"and enables shared-expert multistream overlap; Decode disables that overlap."
+msgstr ""
+"两个角色均使用 Model Runner V2、`--max-model-len 1049600`、`--max-num-seqs 1`、`--kv-"
+"cache-dtype auto`、FLASHCOMM1、chunked prefill 以及纯文本服务。前缀缓存、异步调度、shared-expert"
+" DP、静态 kernel 和 EAGLE3 均已禁用。Prefill 将 60 层拆分为 `30,30` 并启用 shared-expert "
+"多流重叠；Decode 禁用该重叠。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Both P and D use `--enforce-eager` with `cudagraph_mode=NONE` in this PD "
+"configuration. The earlier Decode candidate using `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` and an "
+"automatically sized KV cache failed during allocation in the tested "
+"environment. The successful configuration uses a Decode token budget and "
+"long-prefill threshold of `8`, plus an explicit KV cache budget of "
+"`47620449894` bytes (about 44.35 GiB) per worker. This is a functional long-"
+"context deployment example; tune performance separately."
+msgstr ""
+"在此 PD 配置中，P 和 D 均使用 `--enforce-eager` 并设置 `cudagraph_mode=NONE`。此前使用 "
+"`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 和自动调整 KV cache 大小的 Decode 候选方案在测试环境中分配阶段失败。成功的配置使用 Decode"
+" token 预算和 long-prefill 阈值 `8`，并为每个 worker 显式设置 `47620449894` 字节（约 44.35 "
+"GiB）的 KV cache 预算。这是一个可用的长上下文部署示例；性能需另行调优。"
+
+msgid "##### 5.4.2.1 Preparation"
+msgstr "##### 5.4.2.1 准备工作"
+
+msgid ""
+"Prepare the model containers, W8A8 weights, cross-node communication, and "
+"Mooncake dependencies as described in Sections 3, 4, and 5.3.1. Run the "
+"following commands inside the prepared containers. Replace the IP/NIC "
+"placeholders with each host's communication-network IP and matching "
+"interface, and set the weight directory visible inside every container. "
+"Adjust the CANN environment-script path if the installation uses a different"
+" location. On multi-NIC hosts, check startup logs to ensure that the "
+"advertised host addresses use the intended communication network; the "
+"HCCL/GLOO interface settings alone do not control every component's address "
+"selection."
+msgstr ""
+"按照第 3、4 和 5.3.1 节的说明准备模型容器、W8A8 权重、跨节点通信和 Mooncake 依赖。在准备好的容器内运行以下命令。将 "
+"IP/网卡占位符替换为各主机的通信网络 IP 及匹配的网卡接口，并设置在每个容器内均可见的权重目录。如果安装路径不同，请调整 CANN "
+"环境脚本路径。在多网卡主机上，请检查启动日志，确保通告的主机地址使用预期的通信网络；仅设置 HCCL/GLOO 接口并不能控制所有组件的地址选择。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Reuse `launch_online_dp.py` from Section 5.3.1. Create separate role "
+"directories on each relevant host:"
+msgstr "复用 5.3.1 节的 `launch_online_dp.py`。在每台相关主机上创建独立的角色目录："
+
+msgid ""
+"Save a copy of `launch_online_dp.py` in each role directory that will be "
+"used. Save the Prefill template below as "
+"`~/minimax-m3-1m-pd/prefill/run_dp_template.sh` on P, and the Decode "
+"template as `~/minimax-m3-1m-pd/decode/run_dp_template.sh` on both D nodes. "
+"Keep the role directories separate even when using shared storage: the "
+"launcher reads `./run_dp_template.sh` from its working directory."
+msgstr ""
+"将 `launch_online_dp.py` 的副本保存到每个将要使用的角色目录中。在 P 上将下方的 Prefill 模板保存为 "
+"`~/minimax-m3-1m-pd/prefill/run_dp_template.sh`，在两台 D 节点上将 Decode 模板保存为 "
+"`~/minimax-m3-1m-pd/decode/run_dp_template.sh`。即使使用共享存储，也要保持角色目录相互独立：启动器会从其工作目录读取"
+" `./run_dp_template.sh`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The four Decode engines share one global DP group. Each process serves one "
+"DP rank with `--data-parallel-size-local 1`; the launcher's `--dp-size-local"
+" 2` starts two such processes per D host. Both D hosts must use the first D "
+"host's IP as `DP_ADDRESS`, and use different global DP rank ranges. If "
+"changing TP/PP/DP, update both roles' `kv_connector_extra_config` and all "
+"launch mappings together."
+msgstr ""
+"四个 Decode 引擎共享一个全局 DP 组。每个进程通过 `--data-parallel-size-local 1` 服务一个 DP "
+"rank；启动器的 `--dp-size-local 2` 会在每台 D 主机上启动两个这样的进程。两台 D 主机都必须使用第一台 D 主机的 IP "
+"作为 `DP_ADDRESS`，并使用不同的全局 DP rank 范围。如果更改 TP/PP/DP，请同时更新两个角色的 "
+"`kv_connector_extra_config` 以及所有启动映射。"
+
+msgid "##### 5.4.2.2 Service Scripts"
+msgstr "##### 5.4.2.2 服务脚本"
+
+msgid "**1. Prefill node: `prefill/run_dp_template.sh`**"
+msgstr "**1. Prefill 节点：`prefill/run_dp_template.sh`**"
+
+msgid "**2. Decode nodes: `decode/run_dp_template.sh`**"
+msgstr "**2. Decode 节点：`decode/run_dp_template.sh`**"
+
+msgid ""
+"The command above retains the tested `--kv-cache-memory-bytes 47620449894` "
+"value. If adjusting it for another environment, use the following guidance:"
+msgstr ""
+"上述命令保留了经过测试的 `--kv-cache-memory-bytes 47620449894` 值。如果针对其他环境进行调整，请参考以下指导："
+
+msgid ""
+"- **Meaning and units:** `--kv-cache-memory-bytes` specifies the KV cache budget per NPU worker, in bytes (1 GiB = 1,073,741,824 bytes). `47620449894` (about 44.35 GiB) is the tested example for this layout, not a fixed MiniMax-M3 requirement. When set explicitly, it overrides `--gpu-memory-utilization` for KV cache sizing; the two values are not added together.\n"
+"- **Choosing a value:** Keep the same value in both Decode templates. Size it for the least available NPU memory across the Decode workers after accounting for model weights, communication buffers, activations, and operator workspaces, with runtime headroom. Recheck this budget when changing hardware, TP/PP, KV dtype, or software versions.\n"
+"- **Checking capacity:** After startup, confirm the reported KV token capacity can support `--max-model-len 1049600`, then verify a 1M-token request. A value that is too large can cause an out-of-memory error; a value that is too small cannot hold the required context. If the required KV cache cannot fit, revise the parallel layout rather than assuming a smaller allocation still supports 1M tokens."
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid "`HCCL_BUFFSIZE` is `256` on P and `64` on D."
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid "##### 5.4.2.3 Start the Services"
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid "**2. First Decode node: global DP ranks 0–1**"
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid ""
+"This starts the DP coordinator and the first two engines. Keep this command "
+"running and start the second D host from another shell; do not wait for the "
+"first D host to become fully healthy before starting the second."
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid "**3. Second Decode node: global DP ranks 2–3**"
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid "The launcher's device assignment is:"
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid "| Host / DP rank | Local logical NPUs | API port |"
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid ""
+"Wait for all five APIs to report `Application startup complete` and return "
+"HTTP 200 from `/health`. Run the two D launch commands concurrently until "
+"their shared initialization completes."
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid "**4. Proxy: one Prefill endpoint and four Decode endpoints**"
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid ""
+"Use `load_balance_proxy_server_example.py` from Section 5.3.1. Run it in a "
+"container that can reach all five engine APIs, for example on P. Replace all"
+" three IP placeholders. This topology has four D endpoints; use the mapping "
+"below rather than the eight-endpoint mapping for the ordinary-context A3 "
+"example."
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid ""
+"Send client requests to `http://<PROXY_HOST_IP>:18919/v1/chat/completions`. "
+"The `0.0.0.0` value is the proxy's listen address."
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid "##### 5.4.2.4 Verification"
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Check all five `/health` endpoints and each engine's reported KV token capacity before sending a long request.\n"
+"2. Send a short text request through the proxy and verify the generated answer.\n"
+"3. Prepare a prompt containing exactly 1,048,576 tokens using the deployed model's tokenizer. Keep input plus requested output within `1049600`; the configuration reserves up to 1024 output tokens for a full 1M-token input.\n"
+"4. Verify the API's input-token count and the requested retrieval answers. Check the Prefill prompt-token counter and the receiving Decode rank's external-prefix-cache hit counter to confirm the long prefix was transferred. Decode should not recompute the complete 1M prefill."
+msgstr ""
+
+msgid ""
+"The recorded A3 run used vLLM `0.30.0+empty` and vLLM-Ascend "
+"`0.30.0rc2.dev166+g7672a5b50`. All five engines were healthy, and one real "
+"request with 1,048,576 input tokens and 33 output tokens correctly retrieved"
+" three random values placed across the context. P processed 1,048,576 prompt"
+" tokens; the receiving D rank reported the same transferred-prefix hit "
+"increment and 33 iteration tokens, with no preemption. This validates one "
+"1M-context PD request. It does not establish four simultaneous 1M requests "
+"or an AISBench performance result. The templates retain that run's serving "
+"parameters and KV topology, with environment exports normalized to this "
+"guide. These normalized snippets have not been rerun on NPUs, and the "
+"existing validation container was not fully audited for pre-existing "
+"changes. Recheck compatibility when reproducing on a different build."
+msgstr ""
