+msgid "### 5.6 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (A2)"
+msgstr "### 5.6 Prefill-Decode 分离（A2）"
+
+msgid ""
+"For Atlas 800 A2 (64G x 8), we recommend deploying 1P1D with 2 nodes for "
+"`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a8-mtp`:"
+msgstr ""
+"对于 Atlas 800 A2（64G x 8），针对 `Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a8-mtp`，我们推荐使用 2 个节点部署 "
+"1P1D："
+
+msgid ""
+"- 1 Prefill node: 1 Atlas 800 A2 (64G x 8).\n"
+"- 1 Decode node: 1 Atlas 800 A2 (64G x 8)."
+msgstr ""
+"- 1 个 Prefill 节点：1 台 Atlas 800 A2（64G x 8）。\n"
+"- 1 个 Decode 节点：1 台 Atlas 800 A2（64G x 8）。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.6.1 Prefill Node"
+msgstr "#### 5.6.1 Prefill 节点"
+
+msgid "#### 5.6.2 Decode Node"
+msgstr "#### 5.6.2 Decode 节点"
+
+msgid ""
+"Common Issues Tip: If the decode node fails to initialize, check that "
+"`--tensor-parallel-size` is 8, `--data-parallel-size-local` matches the "
+"global decode DP size (1), and `kv_connector_extra_config.decode.dp_size` "
+"matches the global decode DP size."
+msgstr ""
+"常见问题提示：如果 Decode 节点初始化失败，请检查 `--tensor-parallel-size` 是否为 8、`--data-"
+"parallel-size-local` 是否与全局 Decode DP 大小（1）一致，以及 "
+"`kv_connector_extra_config.decode.dp_size` 是否与全局 Decode DP 大小一致。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--distributed-executor-backend mp` uses multiprocessing on each node for the local workers.\n"
+"- Prefill uses `--data-parallel-size 1`, and `--tensor-parallel-size 8`. This creates 1 DP group with TP8.\n"
+"- Decode uses `--data-parallel-size 1`, and `--tensor-parallel-size 8`. This creates 1 DP group with TP8.\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-address` and `--data-parallel-rpc-port` define the DP control plane.\n"
+"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` is larger on the prefill node and smaller on the decode node because prefill is prompt-token intensive while decode is latency sensitive.\n"
+"- `recompute_scheduler_enable` sends requests back to the prefill side to recompute KV cache when decode KV cache is insufficient. Enable it only on the decode node in PD mode.\n"
+"- `--kv-transfer-config` sets the Mooncake connector. `kv_role` is `kv_producer` on prefill and `kv_consumer` on decode.\n"
+"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and `decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP and TP layout.\n"
+"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` is recommended on the decode node to reduce decode dispatch overhead."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--distributed-executor-backend mp` 在每个节点上为本地 worker 使用多进程。\n"
+"- Prefill 使用 `--data-parallel-size 1` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size 8`。这会创建 1 个 TP8 的 DP 组。\n"
+"- Decode 使用 `--data-parallel-size 1` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size 8`。这会创建 1 个 TP8 的 DP 组。\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-address` 和 `--data-parallel-rpc-port` 定义 DP 控制平面。\n"
+"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` 在 Prefill 节点上较大，在 Decode 节点上较小，因为 Prefill 是 prompt token 密集型，而 Decode 对延迟敏感。\n"
+"- `recompute_scheduler_enable` 在 Decode KV cache 不足时，将请求发回 Prefill 侧重新计算 KV cache。在 PD 模式下仅在 Decode 节点上启用。\n"
+"- `--kv-transfer-config` 设置 Mooncake 连接器。`kv_role` 在 Prefill 上为 `kv_producer`，在 Decode 上为 `kv_consumer`。\n"
+"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 `decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须与实际全局 DP 和 TP 布局一致。\n"
+"- 推荐在 Decode 节点上使用 `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 以减少 Decode 调度开销。"
+
+msgid "### 5.7 Request Forwarding"
+msgstr "### 5.7 请求转发"
+
+msgid ""
+"For A2 PD disaggregation (1P1D), the proxy forwards requests to 1 prefill "
+"node and 1 decode node. Use the standard proxy script."
+msgstr "对于 A2 PD 分离（1P1D），代理将请求转发到 1 个 Prefill 节点和 1 个 Decode 节点。请使用标准代理脚本。"
