 msgstr "静态 EPLB 计划在 v0.25.1 中移除。"
+
+msgid "## Performance Ceiling Analysis (`enable_force_eplb`)"
+msgstr "## 性能上限分析（`enable_force_eplb`）"
+
+msgid ""
+"`enable_force_eplb` is an analysis-only switch that forces a deterministic\n"
+"round-robin expert routing instead of the real MoE router output. It gives every\n"
+"expert-parallel rank a synthetic, perfectly balanced token distribution, so you can\n"
+"measure the performance upper bound (ceiling) of the expert-parallel / EPLB path\n"
+"under ideal load balance."
+msgstr ""
+"`enable_force_eplb` 是一个仅用于分析的开关，它会强制使用确定性的轮询专家路由，而非真实的 MoE 路由输出。它为每个专家并行 "
+"rank 提供合成的、完全均衡的 token 分布，因此你可以测量专家并行 / EPLB 路径在理想负载均衡下的性能上限（ceiling）。"
+
+msgid ""
+"`enable_force_eplb` replaces the real routing result, so model results and\n"
+"    **accuracy are invalid**. It is **not for production** and must not be used for\n"
+"    correctness or accuracy validation."
+msgstr ""
+"`enable_force_eplb` 会替换真实的路由结果，因此模型结果和**精度是无效的**。它**不适用于生产环境**，不得用于正确性或精度验证。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- Enable it through `additional_config`: `--additional-config '{\"enable_force_eplb\": true}'`.\n"
+"- It requires expert parallelism and a MoE model; `num_logical_experts` must be divisible by the expert-parallel size.\n"
+"- It cannot be combined with `eplb_config.dynamic_eplb`.\n"
+"- See [`enable_force_eplb`](../configuration/additional_config.md) for the full parameter reference."
+msgstr ""
+"- 通过 `additional_config` 启用：`--additional-config '{\"enable_force_eplb\": true}'`。\n"
+"- 它需要专家并行和 MoE 模型；`num_logical_experts` 必须能被专家并行大小整除。\n"
+"- 它不能与 `eplb_config.dynamic_eplb` 组合使用。\n"
+"- 完整参数参考请参见 [`enable_force_eplb`](../configuration/additional_config.md)。"
