+
+msgid "### Upgrading Pools with Strided MLA Caches"
+msgstr "### 升级使用跨步 MLA 缓存的池"
+
+msgid ""
+"Bulk and layerwise pooling transfer MLA components in separate physical-"
+"block segments when a scheduler block contains multiple kernel blocks with "
+"gaps between their payloads. The components must be contiguous inside each "
+"physical block. Partial layerwise transfers copy only the token interval "
+"covered by each segment. Dense cache layouts retain their existing packed "
+"representation."
+msgstr ""
+"当调度器块包含多个内核块且各内核块的有效载荷之间存在间隙时，批量池化和分层池化会在独立的物理块段中传输 MLA "
+"组件。各组件在每个物理块内必须连续。部分分层传输仅复制每个段所覆盖的 token 区间。密集缓存布局保留其现有的打包表示。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Pool objects written by the older contiguous-range implementation are "
+"incompatible with the corrected representation for affected layouts, even "
+"though their total byte size is unchanged. Upgrade all writers and readers "
+"together, and invalidate the affected pool entries or use a fresh cache "
+"namespace. For request-level isolation, use a new `cache_salt` consistently "
+"for requests that should share cached prefixes. Restarting vLLM workers "
+"alone does not invalidate persisted pool objects."
+msgstr ""
+"由旧版连续区间实现写入的池对象，对于受影响的布局，与修正后的表示不兼容，即使其总字节大小未变。请同时升级所有写入方和读取方，并使受影响的池条目失效，或使用全新的缓存命名空间。对于请求级隔离，请对需要共享缓存前缀的请求一致地使用新的"
+" `cache_salt`。仅重启 vLLM worker 并不会使已持久化的池对象失效。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For non-layerwise complete-block transfers, adjacent MLA components sharing "
+"one backing storage are coalesced into one descriptor per physical page, or "
+"one descriptor per logical block when the pages have no gaps. Padding is "
+"never copied. Layerwise transfers, partial-chunk configurations, align-state"
+" groups, decode-cache saving, TP mismatch, DCP and KVPP retain the "
+"component-segment fallback. Registration logs report each coalesced layer "
+"and its descriptor count."
+msgstr ""
+"对于非分层完整块传输，共享同一后备存储的相邻 MLA "
+"组件会合并为每个物理页一个描述符；当各页之间没有间隙时，则合并为每个逻辑块一个描述符。填充内容永远不会被复制。分层传输、部分块配置、对齐状态组、解码缓存保存、TP"
+" 不匹配、DCP 和 KVPP 仍保留组件段回退方案。注册日志会报告每个合并后的层及其描述符数量。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This bulk fast path uses physical-page-major object contents instead of the "
+"previous component-major segmented contents. A fresh namespace is required "
+"even when upgrading from the earlier segmented version of this fix. Writers "
+"and readers must agree on transfer mode and cache layout; do not share these"
+" objects with layerwise readers or workers using a different component "
+"layout."
+msgstr ""
+"此批量快速路径使用以物理页为主序的对象内容，而非之前的以组件为主序的分段内容。即使是从此修复的早期分段版本升级，也需要使用全新的命名空间。写入方和读取方必须在传输模式和缓存布局上保持一致；请勿将这些对象与分层读取方或使用不同组件布局的"
+" worker 共享。"
+
+msgid ""
+"**Low eviction watermark:** With a 100 GB DRAM pool, "
+"`eviction_high_watermark_ratio=0.5` triggers eviction at 50 GB. If the "
+"warmup working set exceeds this threshold, data can be evicted before "
+"asynchronous SSD writes finish, leaving the benchmark with a cold cache and "
+"a lower initial hit rate."
+msgstr ""
+"**低驱逐水位线：** 对于 100 GB 的 DRAM 池，`eviction_high_watermark_ratio=0.5` 会在 50 GB "
+"时触发驱逐。如果预热工作集超过此阈值，数据可能在异步 SSD 写入完成之前就被驱逐，导致基准测试处于冷缓存状态，初始命中率偏低。"
+
+msgid ""
+"To preserve warmup data under memory pressure, set `enable_ssd_offload=true`"
+" in `mooncake.json` and enable offload-on-evict on the master:"
+msgstr ""
+"为了在内存压力下保留预热数据，请在 `mooncake.json` 中设置 `enable_ssd_offload=true`，并在 master "
+"上启用驱逐时卸载（offload-on-evict）："
+
+msgid ""
+"`offload_on_evict` defaults to `false`. When enabled, eviction queues "
+"objects without a `LOCAL_DISK` replica for offload and pins one memory "
+"replica while offload is pending. Keep `offload_force_evict=false` to defer "
+"eviction when offload cannot be queued. On Mooncake builds that expose "
+"`offloading_queue_limit`, increase the pending-object limit per local disk "
+"segment as needed (for example, `--offloading_queue_limit=200000`), and "
+"leave DRAM headroom for pending writes."
+msgstr ""
+"`offload_on_evict` 默认为 `false`。启用后，驱逐操作会将没有 `LOCAL_DISK` "
+"副本的对象排队等待卸载，并在卸载挂起期间固定一个内存副本。保持 "
+"`offload_force_evict=false`，以便在无法排队卸载时推迟驱逐。在暴露 `offloading_queue_limit` 的 "
+"Mooncake 构建中，请根据需要提高每个本地磁盘段的待处理对象上限（例如 "
+"`--offloading_queue_limit=200000`），并为待处理写入预留 DRAM 余量。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Only worker clients own local SSD storage. Each worker uses "
+"`ssd_offload_path/rank_<global_rank>/`, where the global rank includes the "
+"DP offset and TP/PP/CP ranks. Scheduler clients do not enable local SSD "
+"offload. In a single-node DP=2 deployment, both replicas can use the same "
+"`mooncake.json`: their workers use distinct rank subdirectories and their "
+"schedulers do not claim the shared root directory. Separate vLLM services "
+"whose global ranks overlap must use different `ssd_offload_path` roots."
+msgstr ""
+"只有 worker 客户端拥有本地 SSD 存储。每个 worker 使用 "
+"`ssd_offload_path/rank_<global_rank>/`，其中全局 rank 包含 DP 偏移量以及 TP/PP/CP "
+"rank。调度器客户端不启用本地 SSD 卸载。在单节点 DP=2 部署中，两个副本可以使用相同的 `mooncake.json`：它们的 worker"
+" 使用不同的 rank 子目录，且它们的调度器不会占用共享的根目录。全局 rank 重叠的独立 vLLM 服务必须使用不同的 "
+"`ssd_offload_path` 根目录。"
+
+msgid ""
+"If startup reports `storage_path already held by another live client`, "
+"another client holds the local directory lock. This message comes from "
+"Mooncake's client-side bucket backend. Check the Mooncake package and native"
+" libraries loaded by vLLM and the live clients using the reported directory;"
+" the `mooncake_master` version alone does not identify the client's locking "
+"implementation. The `Mooncake SSD offload enabled` log reports the actual "
+"worker subdirectory. See the [Mooncake SSD ownership "
+"contract](https://kvcache-ai.github.io/Mooncake/design/store/ssd-"
+"offload.html#bucketstoragebackend-default)."
+msgstr ""
+"如果启动时报告 `storage_path already held by another live "
+"client`，说明另一个客户端持有本地目录锁。此消息来自 Mooncake 的客户端 bucket 后端。请检查 vLLM 加载的 Mooncake "
+"包和原生库，以及正在使用所报告目录的活动客户端；仅凭 `mooncake_master` 版本无法确定客户端的加锁实现。`Mooncake SSD "
+"offload enabled` 日志会报告实际的 worker 子目录。请参阅 [Mooncake SSD "
+"所有权契约](https://kvcache-ai.github.io/Mooncake/design/store/ssd-"
+"offload.html#bucketstoragebackend-default)。"
diff --git a/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.po b/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.po
index 6493338da..c6461ed28 100644
--- a/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.po
+++ b/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.po
@@ -917,3 +917,53 @@ msgid ""
 msgstr ""
 "Synthetic 模式无论草稿 token "
 "是否匹配目标分布都会接受它们，因此生成的输出**在语义上不正确**。仅将其用于基准测试和验证，**切勿用于生产服务**。"
+
+msgid "## Block Verification in Model Runner V2"
+msgstr "## Model Runner V2 中的块验证"
+
+msgid ""
+"Model Runner V2 supports upstream vLLM's block verification for speculative "
+"decoding. It jointly verifies a block of draft tokens using cumulative "
+"target-to-draft probability ratios and samples a recovery token from the "
+"corresponding residual distribution. This can increase the accepted draft "
+"length while preserving the target sampling distribution. Performance gains "
+"depend on the draft model and workload."
+msgstr ""
+"Model Runner V2 支持上游 vLLM 针对投机解码的块验证。它使用累积的目标与草稿概率比值对一组草稿 token "
+"进行联合验证，并从相应的残差分布中采样一个恢复 token。这可以在保持目标采样分布的同时提高被接受的草稿长度。性能收益取决于草稿模型和工作负载。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Model Runner V2 is enabled by default (`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`). To "
+"enable block verification, set `\"rejection_sample_method\": \"block\"` in "
+"`speculative_config`, alongside your existing proposer settings. The default"
+" remains `\"standard\"`; omit this field or set it to `\"standard\"` to "
+"disable block verification."
+msgstr ""
+"Model Runner V2 默认启用（`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`）。要启用块验证，请在 "
+"`speculative_config` 中设置 `\"rejection_sample_method\": \"block\"`，并保留现有的 "
+"proposer 设置。默认值仍为 `\"standard\"`；省略该字段或将其设置为 `\"standard\"` 即可禁用块验证。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Block verification supports both greedy and probabilistic draft sampling. "
+"Target requests with `temperature=0` retain greedy verification behavior. It"
+" cannot be combined with synthetic rejection sampling; do not set "
+"`synthetic_acceptance_rates` or `synthetic_acceptance_length` when using "
+"`\"block\"`."
+msgstr ""
+"块验证同时支持贪心和概率草稿采样。`temperature=0` 的目标请求保持贪心验证行为。它不能与合成拒绝采样结合使用；使用 `\"block\"`"
+" 时不要设置 `synthetic_acceptance_rates` 或 `synthetic_acceptance_length`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Block Verify and Entropy Verify currently support Model Runner V1 only. Set "
+"`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` before starting the server or offline inference"
+" process, then configure these features through "
+"`additional_config.rejection_sampler_config` as shown below. Model Runner V2"
+" is enabled by default; its block verification is configured through "
+"`speculative_config.rejection_sample_method`, as described in [Block "
+"Verification in Model Runner V2](#block-verification-in-model-runner-v2)."
+msgstr ""
+"Block Verify 和 Entropy Verify 目前仅支持 Model Runner V1。在启动服务器或离线推理进程之前，请设置 "
+"`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`，然后按下文所示通过 "
+"`additional_config.rejection_sampler_config` 配置这些功能。Model Runner V2 "
+"默认启用；其块验证通过 `speculative_config.rejection_sample_method` 配置，如 [Model Runner "
+"V2 中的块验证](#block-verification-in-model-runner-v2) 所述。"
